&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_i̇ki_video_eklentisi_i̇ki_kullanım_amacı&quot;&gt;İki Video Eklentisi, İki Kullanım Amacı&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_yol_haritasının_6_epici&quot;&gt;Yol Haritasının 6 EPIC&amp;#8217;i&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_neden_çalışır&quot;&gt;Neden Çalışır&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sonuç_kayıp_halka&quot;&gt;Sonuç: Kayıp Halka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_referanslar&quot;&gt;Referanslar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi: 8 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İki hafta önce başlattım`capsule-gradle`— bir desteyi dönüştüren bir eklenti TTS ile WebM video kapsülünde reveal.js. Bugün yeni bir eklenti ekliyorum: &lt;code&gt;hyperframes-gradle&lt;/code&gt;. capsule-gradle&amp;#8217;in yapmadığı bir şeyi yapıyor: AsciiDoc&amp;#8217;u reveal.js üzerinden geçmeden &lt;strong&gt;doğrudan&lt;/strong&gt; MP4 videoya dönüştürmek.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İşte bu eklentinin var olma nedeni ve mevcut sistemle nasıl eklemlendiği, ve HeyGen&amp;#8217;in HyperFrames motorunun içerik üretim hattına neler kattığı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_video_pipelineındaki_boşluk&quot;&gt;Video Pipeline&amp;#8217;ındaki Boşluk&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dokümantasyon hattım iki tür video üretmektedir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tekrar Modülü&lt;/strong&gt; (capsule-gradle) — WebM ile kaydedilmiş bir reveal.js sunumu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TTS anlatımı. Bir modülü tekrar gözden geçirmek için mükemmel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Animasyon slaytları&lt;/strong&gt; (slider-gradle) — etkileşimli bir reveal.js HTML sunumu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;yüz yüze eğitmen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ancak üçüncü bir format eksik: &lt;strong&gt;standalone video&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5565%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kullanım durumu&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Güncel çözüm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Eksik&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Eğitmen slaytları&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;slider-gradle → reveal.js&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;✅&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Tekrar kapsülü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;capsule-gradle → WebM&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Lütfen çevrilmesini istediğiniz metni gönderin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teaser video&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiçbiri&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;❌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Animasyonlu teknik demo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiçbiri&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;❌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belgeden videoya&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiçbiri&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;❌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İlk kullanım durumu kritiktir: nasıl otomatik olarak oluşturulur GSAP animasyonları içeren, bir projeyi veya modülü tanıtan 60 saniyelik bir video, TTS anlatımı, müzik altyapısı — tamamı aynı AsciiDoc dosyasından sadece slaytlar mı?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capsule-gradle yanıt veremez: &lt;strong&gt;zaten&lt;/strong&gt; bir reveal.js destesine ihtiyacı var. slider-gradle bu desteyi düzgün bir şekilde oluşturuyor, ancak video işleme için tasarlanmamış. &lt;strong&gt;Doğrudan&lt;/strong&gt; bir pipeline gerekiyordu: AsciiDoc → video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_hyperframes_motor&quot;&gt;HyperFrames: Motor&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keşfettimhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes[HyperFrames] il y a birkaç gün. HeyGen tarafından oluşturulmuş açık kaynaklı (Apache 2.0) bir framework&amp;#8217;tür, yapay zeka videosunun tek boynuzlu atı. GitHub&amp;#8217;da 22.700 yıldız. Pitch şu şekilde özetlenebilir: bir cümle:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;quoteblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HTML yazın. Videoyu işleyin. Ajanlar için oluşturuldu.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prensip şudur: HTML&amp;#8217;i şu şekilde yazarsınız`data-*`öznitelikleri, referans veriyorsunuz bir GSAP animasyonu (veya CSS, Lottie, Three.js…), ve motor tüm bunları MP4 olarak işler Puppeteer (headless Chrome) + FFmpeg aracılığıyla. Deterministik sonuç: aynı girdi, aynı kareler, aynı video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;div id=&quot;stage&quot; data-composition-id=&quot;intro&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-width=&quot;1920&quot; data-height=&quot;1080&quot;&amp;gt;
  &amp;lt;video class=&quot;clip&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-duration=&quot;6&quot; data-track-index=&quot;0&quot;
         src=&quot;background.mp4&quot; muted playsinline&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/video&amp;gt;

  &amp;lt;h1 id=&quot;title&quot; class=&quot;clip&quot; data-start=&quot;1&quot; data-duration=&quot;4&quot; data-track-index=&quot;1&quot;&amp;gt;
    Formation Docker &amp;amp; Kubernetes
  &amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;

  &amp;lt;audio data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-duration=&quot;6&quot; data-track-index=&quot;2&quot;
         data-volume=&quot;0.3&quot; src=&quot;music.wav&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/audio&amp;gt;

  &amp;lt;script src=&quot;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;
  &amp;lt;script&amp;gt;
    const tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });
    tl.from(&quot;#title&quot;, { opacity: 0, y: 40, duration: 0.8 }, 1);
    window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};
    window.__timelines.intro = tl;
  &amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HyperFrames&amp;#8217;ı Remotion&amp;#8217;dan farklı kılan nedir? React yok, yok bundler, JSX yok. Yapay zeka ajanlarının yerel olarak yazabildiği ham HTML. Tam &lt;strong&gt;olarak&lt;/strong&gt; benim pipeline&amp;#8217;ım için biçilmiş kaftan: deepseek ile planner-gradle bir SPG/SPD planından ve bir Gradle eklentisinden bu HTML&amp;#8217;i oluşturabilir onu MP4&amp;#8217;e dönüştürebilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_eklenti_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Eklenti Mimarisi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;hyperframes-gradle tüm pluginlerimle aynı deseni izliyor: &lt;a href=&quot;0124_architecture_plugin_gradle_racine_consommateur_independant_post.html&quot;&gt;« Bağımsız Eklenti + Tüketici Kökü » deseni&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;hyperframes-gradle/
├── settings.gradle.kts          ← racine consommateur (dogfood)
├── build.gradle.kts              ← 3 lignes : apply plugin hyperframes
├── hyperframes-plugin/           ← BUILD INDÉPENDANT
│   ├── gradlew                    ← son propre wrapper
│   ├── build.gradle.kts           ← java-gradle-plugin
│   ├── src/main/kotlin/education/cccp/hyperframes/
│   │   ├── HyperframesPlugin.kt
│   │   ├── GenerateHyperframesHtmlTask.kt
│   │   ├── RenderHyperframesTask.kt
│   │   └── HyperframesExtension.kt
│   ├── .agents/                   ← gouvernance agent
│   └── doc/
│       └── HYPERFRAMES_ARCHITECTURE.adoc
└── video.yml                      ← configuration dogfood&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_dört_adımlı_pipeline&quot;&gt;Dört Adımlı Pipeline&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/pipeline-hyperframes.svg&quot; alt=&quot;pipeline hyperframes&quot; width=&quot;1007&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AsciidoctorJ&lt;/strong&gt;, AsciiDoc kaynağını ayrıştırır ve özel blokları çıkarır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;[hyperframes-composition]&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;[hyperframes-track]&lt;/code&gt;, `[hyperframes-animation]`Lütfen çevirmek istediğiniz metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenerateHyperframesHtmlTask&lt;/strong&gt;, HyperFrames HTML&amp;#8217;ini şu şekilde oluşturur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`data-*`karşılık gelen öznitelikler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RenderHyperframesTask&lt;/strong&gt;, HyperFrames CLI&amp;#8217;sini şu şekilde çağırır:`ProcessBuilder`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`npx hyperframes render --input index.html --output video.mp4`Lütfen çevirmek istediğiniz metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MP4 şurada konuşlandırılmıştır:`output/`bir &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203; ile`metadata.json`orkestrasyon için.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_asciidoc_dsli&quot;&gt;AsciiDoc DSL&amp;#8217;i&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklentinin gerçek katma değeri, AsciiDoc DSL&amp;#8217;dir. Kullanıcı asla HTML yazmaz. Mevcut AsciiDoc belgesini şu şekilde notlandırır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;= Formation Docker &amp;amp; Kubernetes
:hyperframes-width: 1920
:hyperframes-height: 1080
:hyperframes-fps: 30

[hyperframes-composition, id=&quot;intro&quot;]
== Introduction

Le titre apparaît avec un fondu GSAP sur fond vidéo.

[hyperframes-track, index=0, start=0, duration=6]
video::assets/background.mp4[muted, playsinline]

[hyperframes-track, index=1, start=1, duration=4]
Formation Docker &amp;amp; Kubernetes

[hyperframes-animation, type=gsap]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;const tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true }); tl.from(&quot;#title&quot;, { opacity: 0, y: 40, duration: 0.8 }, 1); window.&lt;em&gt;timelines = window.&lt;/em&gt;timelines || {}; window.__timelines.intro = tl;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;docinfo nitelikleri (&lt;code&gt;:hyperframes-width:&lt;/code&gt;) boyutları yapılandırır. Custom blokları kompozisyonları ve track&amp;#8217;leri tanımlar. Blok `[hyperframes-animation]`ham GSAP kodu içerir — yapay zeka aracısının doğal dil açıklamasından oluşturabilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_node_js_bridgei&quot;&gt;Node.js Bridge&amp;#8217;i&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teknik sürtünmenin tek noktası: HyperFrames &lt;code&gt;Node.js/TypeScript&lt;/code&gt; ile yazılmıştır, ve eklentilerim Kotlin/JVM dilinde. Çözüm bir`ProcessBuilder`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;class RenderHyperframesTask : DefaultTask() {

    @TaskAction
    fun render() {
        val process = ProcessBuilder(
            &quot;npx&quot;, &quot;hyperframes&quot;, &quot;render&quot;,
            &quot;--input&quot;, inputHtml.absolutePath,
            &quot;--output&quot;, outputMp4.absolutePath
        )
            .inheritIO()
            .start()

        val exitCode = process.waitFor()
        require(exitCode == 0) {
            &quot;HyperFrames render failed with exit code $exitCode&quot;
        }
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JVM ↔ Node.js arasında sıfır kod bağımlılığı. Sözleşme komut satırı üzerinden sağlanır. ve diskteki dosyalar. Bu, şuyla aynı desendir:`plantuml-gradle` (PlantUML CLI&amp;#8217;yı çağıran) veya`slider-gradle`(AsciidoctorJ&amp;#8217;yi çağıran). Güneşin altında yeni bir şey yok — sadece daha yeni bir araca uygulandı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇ki_video_eklentisi_i̇ki_kullanım_amacı&quot;&gt;İki Video Eklentisi, İki Kullanım Amacı&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
