&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sonuç_rakamların_hükmü&quot;&gt;Sonuç: Rakamların Hükmü&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_referanslar&quot;&gt;Referanslar&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_tarife_kaynakları&quot;&gt;Tarife Kaynakları&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi: 22 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bana sık sık yapay zeka tüketimimin ne kadar tuttuğu soruluyor. &quot;Ayda 20 lira&quot; diye cevap verdiğimde bana şaşkın gözlerle bakıyorlar. Bu yüzden bugün, size kara kutuyu açıyorum. Bu makale, 73 günlük vibe coding sürecimin eksiksiz denetimidir: OpenCode&amp;#8217;un SQLite veri tabanından verileri çıkarma metodolojisi, tabloları sorgulamak için kullanılan SQL kodu ve piyasadaki —Batılı veya Çinli— &lt;strong&gt;tüm&lt;/strong&gt; sağlayıcılarla yapılan kapsamlı karşılaştırma. Sonuç o kadar asimetrik ki, hesaplamalarımı üç kez kontrol etmek zorunda kaldım.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;içindekiler&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- toc disabled --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_stackı_anlamak_kim_ne_yapar&quot;&gt;Stack&amp;#8217;ı Anlamak: Kim Ne Yapar?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rakamlara dalmadan önce mimariyi netleştirelim. Kurulumumda üç farklı aktör var ve bunları birbirine karıştırmamak önemli:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/stack-architecture.svg&quot; alt=&quot;stack architecture&quot; width=&quot;2421&quot; height=&quot;417&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock important&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-important&quot; title=&quot;❗&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenCode bir model sağlayıcısı DEĞİLDİR.&lt;/strong&gt;Bu, açık kaynaklı bir CLI (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode&quot;&gt;github.com/anomalyco/opencode&lt;/a&gt;) yapay zeka ajanlarını yöneten. Abonelik satmıyor, çıkarım (inference) sağlamıyor. Şununla eşdeğerdir:`git`versiyonlama için: bir hizmet değil, bir araç. &lt;strong&gt;Ollama Cloud çıkarım sağlayıcısıdır.&lt;/strong&gt;Yerel Ollama kurulumum bir &lt;strong&gt;istemci&lt;/strong&gt; gibi davranır — benzersiz bir SSH anahtarı (Cihaz Anahtarı) aracılığıyla Ollama sunucularında kimlik doğrulaması yapar ve etiketlenmiş modellerin yürütülmesini onlara devreder`:cloud`. Pro aboneliği (20€/ay) daha yüksek kotaların kilidini açar ve Docker aracılığıyla aynı makine üzerinde birden fazla hesabın birleştirilmesine olanak tanır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_giriş_neden_denetim&quot;&gt;Giriş: Neden Denetim?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İki ay önce, yerel Ollama kurulumumda modelleri ücretsiz olarak kullanıyordum. Sonra, bulut modellerini (şu etikete sahip olanları`:cloud`) sağlayıcı aracılığıyla`ollama-cloud`Bir ay sonra, kendi hesabı ve SSH anahtarı olan ayrı bir Docker örneği üzerinde ikinci bir abonelik geldi — &lt;a href=&quot;0120_cumuler_deux_abonnements_ollama_pro_docker_post.html&quot;&gt;abonelikleri birleştirme hakkındaki makalem&lt;/a&gt;de açıklanan birleştirme yöntemi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beni kemiren soru şuydu: &lt;strong&gt;aylık bu 20€ haklı çıkarılabilir mi?&lt;/strong&gt; Göz kararıyla değil. Rakamlarla.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yanıtlamak için kesin verilere ihtiyacım vardı. Tahminlere değil. Ortalamalara değil. Token token, model model, oturum oturum &lt;strong&gt;gerçek&lt;/strong&gt; tüketimime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ve OpenCode — CLI — tüm bunları bir SQLite veri tabanında saklar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_opencode_veri_tabanı_bir_altın_madeni&quot;&gt;OpenCode Veri Tabanı: Bir Altın Madeni&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenCode, oturum geçmişinin tamamını şu konumdaki bir SQLite dosyasına kaydeder:`~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db`. La mienne pèse 660 Mo pour 73 jours d&amp;#8217;utilisation — une base de données de production tout à fait respectable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ls -lh ~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db
-rw-r--r-- 1 cheroliv cheroliv 660M mai 18 12:25 opencode.db&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_şema&quot;&gt;Şema&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veritabanı yirmi civarında tablo içeriyor ancak bunlardan üçü denetimimiz için kritik öneme sahip:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/schema-principal.svg&quot; alt=&quot;schema principal&quot; width=&quot;781&quot; height=&quot;397&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tablo`session`genel bir denetim için mükemmeldir: her oturumun kendi toplu token sayımı, kullanılan modeli ve maliyeti vardır. Alan`model`ham JSON&amp;#8217;dur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-json hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;json&quot;&gt;{
  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;deepseek-v4-pro:cloud&quot;,
  &quot;providerID&quot;: &quot;ollama-cloud&quot;,
  &quot;variant&quot;: &quot;default&quot;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock important&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-important&quot; title=&quot;❗&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alan`cost`OpenCode veritabanındaki veriler yalnızca API anahtarı aracılığıyla kullanım bazlı ödenen &lt;strong&gt;harici API ücretlerini&lt;/strong&gt; (Google Gemini, OpenAI, vb.) yansıtmaktadır. Ollama üzerinden yapılan çağrılar —ister yerel olarak ister Ollama Cloud Pro üzerinden olsun— işaretlenmiştir`cost=0`çünkü maliyet sabit (abonelik), token başına değil. Bu çağrıların gerçek maliyeti, aylık aboneliktir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çıkarma_kodu&quot;&gt;Çıkarma Kodu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Herhangi bir şey kurmanıza gerek yok. Node.js 22+, deneysel bir SQLite modülü içerir (&lt;code&gt;node:sqlite&lt;/code&gt;) mükemmel çalışan. İşte bana her şeyi veren betik:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;const { DatabaseSync } = require(&#39;node:sqlite&#39;);
const db = new DatabaseSync(
  `${process.env.HOME}/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db`,
  { readonly: true }
);

// 1. Statistiques globales
const global = db.prepare(`
  SELECT
    COUNT(*) as sessions,
    SUM(tokens_input) as total_input,
    SUM(tokens_output) as total_output,
    SUM(tokens_reasoning) as total_reasoning,
    SUM(tokens_cache_read) as total_cache_read,
    SUM(cost) as total_cost
  FROM session
`).get();

// 2. Ventilation par modèle et fournisseur
const byModel = db.prepare(`
  SELECT
    json_extract(model, &#39;$.id&#39;) as model_id,
    json_extract(model, &#39;$.providerID&#39;) as provider,
    COUNT(*) as sessions,
    SUM(tokens_input) as total_input,
    SUM(tokens_output) as total_output,
    SUM(cost) as total_cost
  FROM session
  WHERE model IS NOT NULL
  GROUP BY model_id, provider
  ORDER BY SUM(tokens_input) DESC
`).all();

// 3. Par mois
const monthly = db.prepare(`
  SELECT
    strftime(&#39;%Y-%m&#39;, datetime(time_created/1000, &#39;unixepoch&#39;)) as month,
    COUNT(*) as sessions,
    SUM(tokens_input) as total_input,
    SUM(tokens_output) as total_output,
    SUM(cost) as total_cost
  FROM session
  WHERE time_created IS NOT NULL
  GROUP BY month
  ORDER BY month
`).all();

// 4. Messages par modèle (détection des changements intra-session)
const msgByModel = db.prepare(`
  SELECT
    json_extract(m.data, &#39;$.model.providerID&#39;) as provider,
    json_extract(m.data, &#39;$.model.modelID&#39;) as model_id,
    COUNT(*) as messages
  FROM message m
  WHERE json_extract(m.data, &#39;$.model&#39;) IS NOT NULL
  GROUP BY provider, model_id
  ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC
`).all();

console.log({ global, byModel, monthly, msgByModel });
db.close();&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;ℹ️&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flag`--experimental-sqlite`Node.js 22.x üzerinde gereklidir. Node.js 24+ üzerinde modül stabildir ve artık bayrak gerektirmez.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuçlar_73_günlük_tüketim&quot;&gt;Sonuçlar: 73 Günlük Tüketim&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_genel_bakış&quot;&gt;Genel Bakış&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Metrik&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Değer&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Bağlam&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenCode Oturumları&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1 022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;ortalama günde ~14 oturum&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Giriş Tokenları&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2,62 milyar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;94,5M önbellek isabeti (cache hit)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Çıktı Token&amp;#8217;ları&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;21 milyon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Giriş/çıkış oranı ~125:1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belirteç Akıl Yürütme&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;141 000&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İhmal edilebilir — neredeyse hiç thinking yok&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harici API maliyeti&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0,22 $&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Abonelik dışı ücretler (Gemini + ücretsiz katmanlar)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu \$0,22 rakamı kritik: Ollama Cloud Pro aboneliğime &lt;strong&gt;ek olarak&lt;/strong&gt; ödediğim her şeyi temsil ediyor. Yani neredeyse hiçbir şey. Abonelik temel ihtiyaçların çoğunu karşılıyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/repartition-mensuelle.svg&quot; alt=&quot;repartition mensuelle&quot; width=&quot;700&quot; height=&quot;193&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mart ve nisan arasındaki yükseliş muazzam: bir ayda ×35. Bu, &quot;test&quot; kullanımından &quot;production&quot; kullanımına geçiştir — Gradle pluginlerim için OpenCode ajanlarını sürekli çalıştırmaya başladığım zaman.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_model_ve_tedarikçiye_göre_dağılım&quot;&gt;Model ve Tedarikçiye Göre Dağılım&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alan`model`tablonun`session`JSON olduğu için,`json_extract()`düzgün bir şekilde havalandırmayı sağlar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 27.2727%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1818%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1818%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1818%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1819%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Model × Sağlayıcı&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Oturumlar&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Please provide the input text you would like me to translate.&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Çıktı&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Maliyet&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;deepseek-v4-pro @ ollama-cloud&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;63&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;220 M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1,94 M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;\$0&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;deepseek-v4-pro @ ollama-b&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;124&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;463 M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;4,15 M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;\$0&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;deepseek-v4-pro @ ollama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;100&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;252 M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2,25 M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;\$0&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
