&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hub.docker.com/r/ollama/ollama&quot;&gt;Docker Hub üzerindeki Ollama Docker görüntüsü&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://opencode.ai/docs/providers/#ollama&quot;&gt;OpenCode — Yapılandırma Sağlayıcısı Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
