&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi: 13 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenCode&amp;#8217;u terminalinizde başlatıyorsunuz, her şey çalışıyor. Agent bir`gh`— bulunamadı. Bir`java -version`— eksik. Bir`node`— hiçbir yerde. Yine de bu araçlar &lt;em&gt;sizin&lt;/em&gt; shell&amp;#8217;inizde mevcut. Sorun mu? OpenCode shell&amp;#8217;ler başlatıyor&lt;strong&gt;etkileşimsiz&lt;/strong&gt;hiç okumayanlar sizin`.zshrc`İşte bunu düzgün bir şekilde teşhis etme ve düzeltme yolu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;içindekiler&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- toc disabled --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sahne_araçlar_dünyasında_kör_bir_ajan&quot;&gt;Sahne: araçlar dünyasında kör bir ajan&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir salı akşamıydı. Yeni kurmuştumhttps://opencode.ai[OpenCode], kodlama yöntemimi dönüştürmeyi vaat eden yapay zeka ajanı. İlk test: ondan GitHub depolarımı listelemesini istemek.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ opencode
&amp;gt; Utilise gh pour lister mes repos
❌ bash: gh: command not found&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tuhaf.`gh`terminalimde mükemmel çalışıyordu. Başka bir şey deniyorum:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; Vérifie la version de Java
❌ bash: java: command not found&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonra :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; Lance le build Gradle
❌ bash: gradle: command not found&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Java, Gradle, Node,&lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt;— ajan için her şey görünmezdi. Benim terminalim ise her şeyi görüyordu. Sanki ajan ve ben iki paralel dünyada yaşıyormuşuz gibi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anlamak için saatler harcadım. Saatlerce&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&lt;code&gt;echo $PATH&lt;/code&gt;, de &lt;code&gt;which java&lt;/code&gt;, artan bir hayal kırıklığıyla. Sonunda problemin araçlar olmadığını anladım — problem şuydu:&lt;strong&gt;kabuk&lt;/strong&gt;. OpenCode, alt süreçler başlatan tüm ajanlar gibi, shell&amp;#8217;ler içerisinde çalışır&lt;strong&gt;etkileşimsiz&lt;/strong&gt;. Ve bu kabuklarda Zsh, doğrudan doğruya sizin`.zshrc`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aşağıdakiler, bu teşhisin, çözümün ve çıkardığım dersin tam hikayesidir. Eğer bir yapay zeka ajanı — &lt;code&gt;OpenCode&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Aider&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Cursor&lt;/code&gt; veya hatta &lt;code&gt;cron&lt;/code&gt; betikleri — kullanıyorsanız, bu sorun bir gün sizinle de karşı karşıya kalacaktır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_hatanın_anatomisi_iki_shell_iki_dünya&quot;&gt;Hatanın anatomisi: iki shell, iki dünya&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir terminal açtığınızda, Zsh onu bir shell olarak işler&lt;strong&gt;etkileşimli&lt;/strong&gt;. Yüklüyor`.zshrc`, her şeyi başlatan: SDKMAN, NVM, pnpm, takma adlar ve şık isteminiz. Ortamınız eksiksizdir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ancak OpenCode bir komut çalıştırdığında, etkileşimli bir terminal başlatmaz. Bir shell başlatır&lt;strong&gt;etkileşimsiz&lt;/strong&gt;— ekran arkasında insan olmayan bir görev kabuğu. Ve Zsh, bu bağlamda, atlar`.zshrc`. Sadece &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203; okuyor`.zshenv`Lütfen çevrilmesini istediğiniz metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu ayrım neden mevcut? Çünkü etkileşimli olmayan bir shell, insan bir kullanıcıye hizmet etmek için değil, scriptleri çalıştırmak için tasarlanmıştır. Arka planda çalışan bir script&amp;#8217;e takma adları (aliases), istemi (prompt) ve tamamlama özelliklerini yüklemek israf olurdu. Sorun şu ki, yürütülebilir dosyaları bulmak için en kritik bilgi olan &lt;code&gt;PATH&lt;/code&gt; değişkeniniz genellikle şurada başlatılır:`.zshrc`, değil`.zshenv`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/probleme-path.svg&quot; alt=&quot;probleme path&quot; width=&quot;535&quot; height=&quot;434&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sorunun kökeni:&lt;strong&gt;Zsh, &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt; dosyasını yalnızca etkileşimli kabuklar için yükler&lt;/strong&gt;. OpenCode, alt süreçler başlatan tüm yapay zeka ajanları gibi, etkileşimsiz kabuklar (non-interactive shells) kullanır. Bu kabuklar yalnızca`.zshenv`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_suçlular_zshrc_vs_zshenv&quot;&gt;Suçlular: .zshrc vs .zshenv&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zsh şunlara sahiptir:&lt;strong&gt;dört başlatma dosyası&lt;/strong&gt;, her biri belirli bir role sahip. Bu zarif bir tasarım — ancak sorunun düğümlendiği nokta da burası:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Dosya&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kaynaklandığında&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Rol&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;PATH&amp;#8217;ı değiştir?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Her zaman&lt;/strong&gt;(etkileşimli + etkileşimsiz + giriş)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Temel ortam değişkenleri, PATH&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;✅ Evet — burası ONUN yeri&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;.zprofile&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yalnızca giriş kabukları&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yavaş komutlar (oturum başına bir kez)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Mümkün&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yalnızca etkileşimli kabuklar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Takma ad, istem, tamamlama, etkileşimli araçlar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;❌ Kritik değişkenler için değil&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;.zlogin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Giriş kabukları (.zshrc sonrası)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hoş geldiniz mesajları, tamamlama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Nadiren&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tablo bir ipucu veriyor, ancak onu derinlemesine anlamak gerekir. Bunu bir evin odaları gibi düşünün:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;.zshenv`dir&lt;strong&gt;giriş holü&lt;/strong&gt;— herkes buradan geçer, ziyaretçi veya sakin. Buraya bir şey koyarsanız, tüm `shell&lt;/code&gt; bunu görebilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`.zshrc`dir ki&lt;strong&gt;salon&lt;/strong&gt;— buraya yalnızca sakinler (etkileşimli shell&amp;#8217;ler) girer. Ziyaretçiler (etkileşimsiz shell&amp;#8217;ler) ise holde kalır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;.zprofile&lt;/code&gt; et `.zlogin`giriş kabukları (SSH ile bağlandığınızda olduğu gibi) için özelleşmiş parçalardır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trajedi şu ki, çoğumuz PATH&amp;#8217;i oturma odasına koyuyoruz. Ve yapay zeka ajanı ise oraya girmeye asla hak sahibi değil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Problem bir diyagramla:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/zsh-init-flow.svg&quot; alt=&quot;zsh init flow&quot; width=&quot;543&quot; height=&quot;404&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir terminal açtığınızda, Zsh etkileşimlidir: şunları okur`.zshrc`, her şey çalışıyor. OpenCode bir komutu yürütmek için bir shell başlattığında, Zsh etkileşimli değildir: atlar`.zshrc`, sadece &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203; okur`.zshenv`. Et si `.zshenv`yok veya PATH içeriğini barındırmıyor — burası bir çöl.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zsh bunu neden yapıyor?&lt;/strong&gt;Bu, Unix&amp;#8217;ten miras kalan bir tasarım seçimidir. Etkileşimli olmayan bir shell şunlar olmalıdır:&lt;strong&gt;hızlı&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;tekrar üretilebilir&lt;/strong&gt;SDKMAN&amp;#8217;in takma adlarını (alias), renkli istemlerini (prompt) ve ağır başlatma işlemlerini bir cron betiğine veya bir yapay zeka ajanına yüklemek yavaş ve kırılgan olurdu. Bu nedenle ayrım mantıklıdır:`.zshenv`temel olarak (değişkenler, PATH),`.zshrc`konfor için (aliaslar, istemler, tamamlamalar). Sorun, esas olanı konforun içine koyduğumuzda ortaya çıkar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_adım_adım_tanı&quot;&gt;Adım adım tanı&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Düzeltmeden önce, tam olarak neyin eksik olduğunu anlamak gerekir. İşte tekrarlanabilir bir teşhis yöntemi — yapay zeka ajanlarıyla çalışıyorsanız bunu yer işaretlerinize ekleyin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_1_aracının_path_yolunu_kontrol_edin&quot;&gt;1. Aracının PATH yolunu kontrol edin&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Etkileşimli terminalinizin gördüklerini, etkileşimli olmayan bir kabuğun —yani OpenCode&amp;#8217;un— gördükleriyle karşılaştırıyoruz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Dans votre terminal interactif (tout fonctionne)
echo $PATH | tr &#39;:&#39; &#39;\n&#39; | grep -v &#39;^/usr&#39; | sort&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tipik sonuç:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;/home/cheroliv/apps
/home/cheroliv/.nvm/versions/node/v22.19.0/bin
/home/cheroliv/.sdkman/candidates/java/current/bin
/home/cheroliv/.sdkman/candidates/gradle/current/bin
/home/cheroliv/.local/share/pnpm
/home/cheroliv/.local/bin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Şimdi, ajanın gördüğünü simüle edelim — etkileşimli olmayan bir shell:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Shell non-interactif : pas de .zshrc
zsh -c &#39;echo $PATH&#39; | tr &#39;:&#39; &#39;\n&#39; | grep -v &#39;^/usr&#39; | sort&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;/home/cheroliv/.local/bin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Altı yoldan beşi yok oldu.&lt;/strong&gt;Ajan, çevresinin %83&amp;#8217;ünden yoksun bırakılmıştır. Bu, sizden mutfak gereçlerinizin yarısı olmadan yemek yapmanızın istenmesi gibidir; su kaynatabilirsiniz ancak başka pek bir şey yapamazsınız.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock warning&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-warning&quot; title=&quot;Warning&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Komut`zsh -c &#39;echo $PATH&#39;`sizin &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&#39;nızdır&lt;strong&gt;1 numaralı teşhis aracı&lt;/strong&gt;. Günlük olarak kullandığınız bir araç sonuçlarda yoksa, yapay zeka aracınız da onu göremeyecektir. Her değişiklikten önce ve sonra test edin`.zshenv`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_2_zshrc_içinde_olup_zshenv_içinde_olmayanları_belirleyin&quot;&gt;2. &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt; içinde olup &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; içinde olmayanları belirleyin&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Şimdi, suçluyu şurada arıyoruz`.zshrc`. Araçlarımızdan bahseden satırları filtreliyoruz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;grep -n &#39;apps\|SDKMAN\|NVM\|PNPM\|PATH&#39; ~/.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tipik olarak şunlar bulunur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;119: PATH=&quot;/usr/bin/python3:$HOME/apps:$PATH&quot;           # ← pas exporté !
171: export NVM_DIR=&quot;$HOME/.nvm&quot;
172: [ -s &quot;$NVM_DIR/nvm.sh&quot; ] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; \. &quot;$NVM_DIR/nvm.sh&quot;   # ← NVM init
176: nvm use --lts --silent                              # ← active une version
179: export PNPM_HOME=&quot;/home/cheroliv/.local/share/pnpm&quot;
187: export SDKMAN_DIR=&quot;$HOME/.sdkman&quot;
188: [[ -s &quot;$HOME/.sdkman/bin/sdkman-init.sh&quot; ]] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; source &quot;$HOME/.sdkman/bin/sdkman-init.sh&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tüm bunlar&lt;strong&gt;görünmez&lt;/strong&gt;OpenCode için. Ve le`PATH`119. satırın bile değil`export`é — mevcut shell&amp;#8217;den hiç ayrılmaz. Bu kritik bir teknik detaydır: şunsuz bir değişken`export`tanımlayan shell&amp;#8217;e yerel kalır. OpenCode tarafından başlatılanlar gibi alt shell&amp;#8217;ler bunu asla miras almaz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_3_zshenv_dosyasının_mevcut_olup_olmadığını_kontrol_edin&quot;&gt;3. &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; dosyasının mevcut olup olmadığını kontrol edin&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;cat ~/.zshenv 2&amp;gt;/dev/null || echo &quot;FICHIER ABSENT&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yanıt « FICHIER ABSENT » ise, asıl mesele buradadır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çözüm_zshenv_doğru_yollar&quot;&gt;Çözüm: .zshenv + doğru yollar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strateji basit ama hassasiyet gerektiriyor: şuna koymak`.zshenv` &lt;strong&gt;yalnızca&lt;/strong&gt;temel yolları, ağır başlatma betiklerini kaynaklamadan. Taşıma yapılmaz`.zshrc`içinde`.zshenv`— temel noktaları çıkarıyoruz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tüm_temel_yolları_içeren_zshenv_dosyasını_oluşturun&quot;&gt;Tüm temel yolları içeren &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; dosyasını oluşturun&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`.zshenv`dir ki&lt;strong&gt;tek dosya&lt;/strong&gt;Zsh&amp;#8217;ın içinde kaynaklanacağını (source edeceğini) garanti ettiği&lt;strong&gt;tümü&lt;/strong&gt;bağlamlar. PATH buraya gitmeli.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;export SDKMAN_DIR=&quot;$HOME/.sdkman&quot;
export NVM_DIR=&quot;$HOME/.nvm&quot;
export PNPM_HOME=&quot;$HOME/.local/share/pnpm&quot;
export PATH=&quot;$HOME/apps:$HOME/.sdkman/candidates/java/current/bin:$HOME/.sdkman/candidates/gradle/current/bin:$HOME/.nvm/current/bin:$PNPM_HOME:$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/.local/share/JetBrains/Toolbox/scripts:/usr/bin/python3:$PATH&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kullanılır`$HOME/.nvm/current/bin`ve değil`$HOME/.nvm/versions/node/v22.19.0/bin`. Nedeni: Node sürümleri değişiyor. Sabit bir yol, bir sonraki sürümde yanlışa dönüşür`nvm install`. Daha fazla ayrıntı sonraki bölümde yer almaktadır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_neden_zshenv_içinde_source_sdkman_init_sh_olmasın&quot;&gt;Neden &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; içinde &lt;code&gt;source sdkman-init.sh&lt;/code&gt; olmasın?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En cazlı yaklaşım, sadece şunun içinde yeniden üretmek olurdu`.zshenv`içinde yaptığımız şey`.zshrc`— başlatma betiklerini kaynakla. On&lt;strong&gt;olabilir&lt;/strong&gt;yapma isteği duymak:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# ❌ MAUVAISE IDÉE
[[ -s &quot;$HOME/.sdkman/bin/sdkman-init.sh&quot; ]] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; source &quot;$HOME/.sdkman/bin/sdkman-init.sh&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sorunlar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yavaş&lt;/strong&gt;Lütfen çevirmek istediğiniz metni girin.`sdkman-init.sh`her shell&amp;#8217;de ağ çözünürlükleri ve doğrulamalar yapar. Etkileşimli olmayan bir shell&amp;#8217;de, bu gereksiz bir maliyettir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hassas&lt;/strong&gt;: SDKMAN etkileşimli bir ortam bekler. Bir pipe veya alt kabukta (sub-shell) başlatılması sessizce başarısız olabilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gereksiz&lt;/strong&gt;: SDKMAN adaylarını şuraya yerleştirir`~/.sdkman/candidates/&amp;lt;tool&amp;gt;/current/bin`— aktif sürüme işaret eden kararlı symlink&amp;#8217;ler. Bunlar kullanılabilir&lt;strong&gt;doğrudan&lt;/strong&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doğru yaklaşım: SDKMAN başlatmasını atlamak ve doğrudan sembolik bağlantılara (symlinks) yönlenmek`current`. Tüm çözümün anahtarı budur:&lt;strong&gt;başlatma kodu yerine dosya yapısını bir sözleşme olarak kullanın&lt;/strong&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/sdkman-approach.svg&quot; alt=&quot;sdkman approach&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_nvm_vakası_versiyon_yöneticisi_iz_bırakmayı_unuttuğunda&quot;&gt;NVM vakası: versiyon yöneticisi iz bırakmayı unuttuğunda&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_nvm_problemi&quot;&gt;NVM problemi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Araştırmamın beni en uzağa götürdüğü yer burasıydı. SDKMAN şık bir tasarıma sahip: şunları yaptığımızda`sdk install java 25.0.2-tem`, bir sembolik bağlantı (&lt;code&gt;symlink&lt;/code&gt;) oluşturur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;~/.sdkman/candidates/java/current -&amp;gt; ~/.sdkman/candidates/java/25.0.2-tem&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu symlink&lt;strong&gt;her zaman güncel&lt;/strong&gt;. Üzerine gelin`.zshenv`ve hangi shell&amp;#8217;i kullanırsanız kullanın kapsam altındasınız. Beautiful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NVM ise, oluşturmaz&lt;strong&gt;hiçbir şey&lt;/strong&gt;tel. Sembolik bağlantı yok`current`. Sabit bir çapa noktası yok. Şuna benzeyen, sabit olarak versiyonlanmış bir yola işaret etmemiz gerekiyor:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;~/.nvm/versions/node/v22.19.0/bin/node&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir sonrakinde`nvm install 24`, bu yol öldü. Sizin`.zshenv`artık aktif olmayan bir sürüme işaret edecektir. Bu, saatli bir bombadır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NVM bunu neden yapıyor?&lt;/strong&gt;NVM, her seferinde PATH&amp;#8217;i dinamik olarak değiştirerek çalışır`nvm use`. Bu, etkileşimli bir shell&amp;#8217;de sık sık versiyon değiştiren geliştiriciler için tasarlanmıştır. Symlink`current`başlangıç özelliklerinde yer almıyordu — bu, kendimizin düzelteceği bir tasarım eksikliğidir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/nvm-vs-sdkman.svg&quot; alt=&quot;nvm vs sdkman&quot; width=&quot;1967&quot; height=&quot;217&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çözüm_nvm_için_current_sembolik_bağlantısını_symlink_oluşturmak&quot;&gt;Çözüm: NVM için &lt;code&gt;current&lt;/code&gt; sembolik bağlantısını (symlink) oluşturmak&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NVM bunu yapmadığı için, biz kendimiz yapıyoruz. Mantık SDKMAN ile aynı — bir symlink`current`her zaman aktif versiyona işaret eden. Bir kez oluşturulur, ardından kendi kendine güncellenmesi için otomatikleştirilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Créer le symlink initial
ln -sfn &quot;$HOME/.nvm/versions/node/v22.19.0&quot; &quot;$HOME/.nvm/current&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Şimdi, içindeki`.zshenv`, şunu kullanırız:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$HOME/.nvm/current/bin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Şundan ziyade:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# ❌ Chemin en dur — cassé au prochain changement de version
$HOME/.nvm/versions/node/v22.19.0/bin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_symlink_güncellemesini_otomatize_etmek&quot;&gt;Symlink güncellemesini otomatize etmek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir symlink, eğer güncellenmiyorsa hiçbir değer taşımaz. Symlink`current`yapıldığında güncellenmelidir`nvm use` ou &lt;code&gt;nvm install&lt;/code&gt;. Çözüm: bir&lt;strong&gt;sarmalayıcı&lt;/strong&gt;— gerçek komutu sarmalayan bir fonksiyon`nvm`ve her çağrıdan sonra symlink&amp;#8217;i günceller.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# À la fin de .zshrc, APRÈS le chargement de NVM
nvm use --lts --silent
ln -sfn &quot;$(nvm_version_path &quot;$(nvm current)&quot;)&quot; &quot;$NVM_DIR/current&quot;

_nvm() {
  command nvm &quot;$@&quot;
  local rc=$?
  ln -sfn &quot;$(nvm_version_path &quot;$(nvm current)&quot;)&quot; &quot;$NVM_DIR/current&quot;
  return $rc
}
alias nvm=&#39;_nvm&#39;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Detaylı olarak nasıl çalışır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/nvm-wrapper-flow.svg&quot; alt=&quot;nvm wrapper flow&quot; width=&quot;740&quot; height=&quot;393&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wrapper`_nvm`gerçek komutu çağırır`nvm`, ardından sembolik bağlantıyı (symlink) günceller. Takma ad (alias)&lt;code&gt;nvm=&#39;_nvm&#39;`yazıldığında &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203; olmasını sağla`nvm&lt;/code&gt;, wrapper üzerinden geçiyoruz. Ve shell başlatıldığında, sonrasında aynısını yapıyoruz`nvm use --lts`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`nvm_version_path`NVM&amp;#8217;nin, bir versiyonun tam yolunu çözen dahili bir fonksiyonudur. Bu, yolun manuel olarak yeniden oluşturulmasını önler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_yollar_özet_tablosu&quot;&gt;Yollar özet tablosu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tuzaklara geçmeden önce, dönüşümün görsel bir özeti. Solda, sahip olduğunuz şey (her şey tek bir`.zshrc`, ajan için görünmez). Sağda ise şu an sahip olduğunuz şey (içindeki temel yollar`.zshenv`, her yerde görünür).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Araç&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Önce (sadece &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Sonra (.zshenv + symlink)&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;OpenCode tarafından görülebilir mi?&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;~/apps&lt;/code&gt;(gh, vscode)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;.zshrc içinde dışa aktarılmamış PATH&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;$HOME/apps&lt;/code&gt;.zshenv içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hazırım.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;SDKMAN Java&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;sdkman-init.sh&lt;/code&gt;.zshrc dosyasında kaynaklandırılmış&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;$HOME/.sdkman/candidates/java/current/bin&lt;/code&gt;.zshenv içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Lütfen çevirilecek metni gönderin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;SDKMAN Gradle&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;sdkman-init.sh&lt;/code&gt;.zshrc dosyası içinde kaynaklandırıldı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;$HOME/.sdkman/candidates/gradle/current/bin&lt;/code&gt;.zshenv içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hazır.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;NVM Node&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvm use --lts&lt;/code&gt;.zshrc içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;$HOME/.nvm/current/bin&lt;/code&gt;.zshenv içinde (sembolik bağlantı)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hazır.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;pnpm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;$PNPM_HOME&lt;/code&gt;.zshrc içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;$PNPM_HOME&lt;/code&gt;.zshenv` içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni gönderin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;JetBrains Toolbox&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Toolbox tarafından .zshrc dosyasına otomatik olarak eklendi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;$HOME/.local/share/JetBrains/Toolbox/scripts&lt;/code&gt;.zshenv içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;✅&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Python 3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`/usr/bin/python3`PATH içindeki .zshrc&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Açıkça &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hazırım.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_tuzaklar_ve_hafifletmeler&quot;&gt;Tuzaklar ve hafifletmeler&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu yaklaşımla ilgili her şey mükemmel değil. Karşılaştığım sorunlar ve bunların nasıl aşılacağı aşağıdadır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Tuzak&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Açıklama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Hafifletme&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yinelenen PATH&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Eğer &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; ve &lt;code&gt;.zshrc&lt;/code&gt; aynı yolu ekliyorsa, bu yol iki kez görünür&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`.zshenv`kaynaklandırılmıştır&lt;strong&gt;önce&lt;/strong&gt;.zshrc. Her ikisi de etkileşimli bir kabukta okunur. PATH yinelenebilir. Bu kozmetiktir, işlevsel değildir. Bunu önlemek için: .zshenv dosyasına yalnızca varsayılan PATH&amp;#8217;de &lt;em&gt;bulunmayan&lt;/em&gt; yolları ekleyin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;NVM : &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; içinde hardcoded versiyon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Koymak`~/.nvm/versions/node/v22.19.0/bin`sabit halı bir sonraki adımda geçersiz olur`nvm install`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Symlink kullanın`$HOME/.nvm/current/bin`+ wrapper`_nvm`.zshrc içinde&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;SDKMAN : &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; içinde &lt;code&gt;sdkman-init.sh&lt;/code&gt; dosyasını source edin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yavaş, kırılgan, etkileşimli olmayan bir shell&amp;#8217;de gereksiz&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Symlink&amp;#8217;leri kullanmak`candidates/&amp;lt;tool&amp;gt;/current/bin`doğrudan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Düzenlemeden sonra eksik takma ad&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Wrapper&amp;#8217;ı`nvm=&#39;_nvm&#39;`.zshrc` içindeki değişiklikler ancak yeniden yüklendikten sonra etkili olur&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kabuğu yeniden başlatın veya`source ~/.zshrc`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;OpenCode değişiklikleri görmüyor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Ajan, alt kabuklarını (sous-shells) eski &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; ile çoktan başlattı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;.zshenv dosyasını değiştirdikten sonra OpenCode&amp;#8217;u yeniden başlatın&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;.zshenv çok yüklü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;.zshenv` dosyasına ağır fonksiyonlar veya etkileşimli başlatmalar eklemek&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;.zshenv = yalnızca ortam değişkenleri + PATH. Değil`source`, ağır fonksiyonlar yok, istemler yok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çıkarılan_dersler&quot;&gt;Çıkarılan Dersler&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.zshrc` etkileşimlidir, &lt;code&gt;.zshenv&lt;/code&gt; evrenseldir&lt;/strong&gt;— Eğer bir değişken &lt;em&gt;tüm&lt;/em&gt; kabuklarda (yapay zeka ajanları, cron, betikler, IDE) mevcut olmalıysa, şuraya eklenir:`.zshenv`Salon rahat, ancak giriş holü herkesin geçtiği tek yer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Versiyon kontrol sistemleri birbirine eşit değildir&lt;/strong&gt;— SDKMAN sembolik bağlantılar (&lt;code&gt;symlinks&lt;/code&gt;) oluşturur`current`tasarımsal olarak. NVM hayır. Bu eksikliğin manuel olarak giderilmesi gerekiyor. Bu önemli bir ders: PATH ayarlarınızı yapmadan önce, yöneticinizin kararlı bir bağlantı noktası sunup sunmadığını kontrol edin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.zshenv` içinde init script&amp;#8217;lerini kaynaklamayın (source yapmayın)&lt;/strong&gt;—&lt;code&gt;sdkman-init.sh&lt;/code&gt; et `nvm.sh`etkileşimli bir kabuk için tasarlanmışlardır. Etkileşimli olmayan bir bağlamda yavaş ve kırılgandırlar. Sembolik bağlantılar (symlinks)`current`yeterlidir ve anlıktır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Her zaman etkileşimli olmayan shell&amp;#8217;de test edin&lt;/strong&gt;—`zsh -c &#39;echo $PATH&#39;`bir temsilcinin gördüklerini tam olarak simüle eder. Bu, doğrulama testidir. Bu test olmadan, yapılandırmanızın temsilciler için çalışıp çalışmadığını bilemezsiniz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wrapper deseni yeniden kullanılabilirdir&lt;/strong&gt;— Aynı desen`_nvm`+`alias nvm=&#39;_nvm&#39;`stabil bir iz bırakmadan PATH&amp;#8217;i dinamik olarak değiştiren her araç için geçerlidir. Bu, fikirler kutunuza eklenmiş bir araç dahadır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/avant-apres.svg&quot; alt=&quot;avant apres&quot; width=&quot;220&quot; height=&quot;306&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_son_kontrol&quot;&gt;Son kontrol&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oluşturduktan sonra`.zshenv`ve NVM sembolik bağlantısı, her iki bağlamda da her şeyin çalıştığını doğrulayın:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Shell interactif (votre terminal)
gh --version &amp;amp;&amp;amp; java -version &amp;amp;&amp;amp; node --version&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Shell non-interactif (simulation OpenCode)
zsh -c &#39;gh --version &amp;amp;&amp;amp; java -version &amp;amp;&amp;amp; node --version&#39;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her ikisinin de başarılı olması gerekir. Eğer öyleyse, yapay zeka aracınız sizinle aynı araçları görecektir. Değilse, adım adım tanıya geri dönün — muhtemelen bir yolu unuttunuz veya NVM symlink&amp;#8217;i güncel değil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bu testi otomatikleştirin.&lt;/strong&gt;Bu doğrulamayı, araçlarınızın her güncellemesinden sonra çalıştırdığınız bir healthcheck betiğine ekleyin. Bir`zsh -c &#39;which java &amp;amp;&amp;amp; which node &amp;amp;&amp;amp; which gh&#39;`CI&amp;#8217;da bu, sürprizlere karşı bir sigortadır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın. Etkileşimli olmayan bir shell, sessiz bir misafir gibidir: yalnızca giriş kapısında yazılı olanı okur. Eğer PATH oturma odasındaysa, onu asla görmeyecektir. Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bağlantılar&quot;&gt;Bağlantılar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_resmi_dokümantasyon&quot;&gt;Resmi dokümantasyon&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zsh.sourceforge.io/Doc/Release/Files.html&quot;&gt;Zsh belgeleri: Başlangıç Dosyaları&lt;/a&gt;— Zsh başlatma dosyaları hakkındaki resmi referans. Sıkça unutulsa da her şeyin açıklandığı yer burasıdır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://opencode.ai/docs/config/&quot;&gt;OpenCode : yapılandırma&lt;/a&gt;— OpenCode ve çalışma ortamının nasıl yapılandırılacağı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bahsedilen_araçlar&quot;&gt;Bahsedilen araçlar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm&quot;&gt;GitHub üzerindeki NVM&lt;/a&gt;— Node Version Manager. Node.js sürüm yöneticisi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sdkman.io&quot;&gt;SDKMAN — resmi site&lt;/a&gt;— SDKMAN! JVM (Java, Kotlin, Gradle&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;) için sürüm yöneticisi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sdkman.io/install&quot;&gt;SDKMAN: kurulum&lt;/a&gt;— SDKMAN Kurulum Kılavuzu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cli.github.com&quot;&gt;gh` — GitHub CLI&lt;/a&gt;— Her geliştirici için vazgeçilmez olan GitHub komut satırı aracı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gradle.org&quot;&gt;Gradle — resmi site&lt;/a&gt;— SDKMAN üzerinden kurduğumuz build sistemi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://pnpm.io&quot;&gt;pnpm — resmi site&lt;/a&gt;— Hızlı ve alan tasarrufu sağlayan Node.js paket yöneticisi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/toolbox-app/&quot;&gt;JetBrains Toolbox&lt;/a&gt;— BetJetBrains IDE yöneticisi, scriptlerini PATH&amp;#8217;e ekler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_daha_fazlası_için&quot;&gt;Daha fazlası için&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.andy2003.org/posts/2022/zsh-dotfiles/&quot;&gt;Zsh dotfiles: kapsamlı bir kılavuz&lt;/a&gt;— Zsh dotfile yönetimi üzerine derinlemesine bir makale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Zsh&quot;&gt;ArchWiki&amp;#8217;de Zsh&lt;/a&gt;— Zsh üzerindeki en iyi topluluk dokümantasyonlarından biri.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm/issues&quot;&gt;NVM sorunları GitHub&lt;/a&gt;— Symlink hakkındaki tartışmaları görmek için`current`ve PATH sorunları.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;İçindekiler&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sorun_diagramlar_her_zaman_koddan_geride_kalıyor&quot;&gt;Sorun: diagramlar her zaman koddan geride kalıyor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_çözüm_bir_deterministik_pipeline_knowledge_graph_plantuml&quot;&gt;Çözüm : bir deterministik pipeline Knowledge Graph → PlantUML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_adım_1_graphifyi_yükleyin_ve_knowledge_graphi_çıkarın&quot;&gt;Adım 1: Graphify&amp;#8217;i yükleyin ve Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;i çıkarın&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_kurulum&quot;&gt;Kurulum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_istisnaları_yapılandır&quot;&gt;Istisnaları yapılandır&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_knowledge_graphı_çıkarma&quot;&gt;Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ı çıkarma&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_adım_2_gradle_eklentisi_knowledge_graphü_plantumle_dönüştürür&quot;&gt;Adım 2: Gradle eklentisi, Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ü PlantUML&amp;#8217;e dönüştürür.&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_pipeline_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Pipeline mimarisi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_i̇ç_bileşenler&quot;&gt;İç bileşenler&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_görüntüleme_kuralları&quot;&gt;Görüntüleme kuralları&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_adım_3_günlük_kullanım&quot;&gt;Adım 3: Günlük kullanım&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_tam_diyagram&quot;&gt;Tam diyagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_topluluk_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Topluluk göre filtrele&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_kenar_tipine_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Kenar tipine göre filtrele&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_düğüm_tipi_ve_güvene_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Düğüm tipi ve güvene göre filtrele&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_özel_çıktı_dizini&quot;&gt;Özel Çıktı Dizini&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_özelliklerin_tam_referansı&quot;&gt;Özelliklerin tam referansı&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_bir_gradle_workflowundaky_tam_pipeline&quot;&gt;Bir Gradle workflow&amp;#8217;undaky tam pipeline&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_i̇ş_akışı_tipi&quot;&gt;İş akışı tipi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_geliştirme_döngüsü_entegrasyonu&quot;&gt;Geliştirme döngüsü entegrasyonu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_artımlı_güncelleme&quot;&gt;Artımlı güncelleme&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_dogfooding_eklenti_kendi_belgesini_yazar&quot;&gt;Dogfooding: Eklenti kendi belgesini yazar.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_neden_determinist_olduğu_ve_neden_önemli&quot;&gt;Neden determinist olduğu (ve neden önemli)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_pipelinenin_kendi_diyagramları&quot;&gt;Pipelinenin kendi diyagramları&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_proje_yönetimine_entegrasyon&quot;&gt;Proje yönetimine entegrasyon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_hazırlık_5_dakikalık_kontrol_listesi&quot;&gt;Hazırlık : 5 dakikalık kontrol listesi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_delikler_ve_azaltmalar&quot;&gt;Delikler ve Azaltmalar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sonuçta_elde_ettiğimiz_şey&quot;&gt;Sonuçta elde ettiğimiz şey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_bağlantılar&quot;&gt;Bağlantılar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Okuma süresi : 12 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Codebaseniz büyüyor. Modüller arasındaki bağımlılıklar artıyor. Mimari dokümantasyon, yazılmadan önce güncelliğini yitiriyor. Ve Gradle build&amp;#8217;inizin &lt;em&gt;otomatik olarak&lt;/em&gt; gerçek kod yapısından güncel diyagramlar üretebileceğinizi hayal edin? Bu, Graphify + PlantUML Gradle Plugin işlem hattının tam olarak yaptığı şey:`graphify . --no-viz`Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ı çıkarır`./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram`onu PlantUML diagramlarına dönüştürür. Sıfır LLM, sıfır kılavuz, %100 determinist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;tik&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- toc disabled --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun_diagramlar_her_zaman_koddan_geride_kalıyor&quot;&gt;Sorun: diagramlar her zaman koddan geride kalıyor&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Binlerce satırı aşan her proje bu sendromu yaşar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projenin başında bir mimari diyagramı çizeriz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kod gelişir, bağımlılıklar değişir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diyagram, dekoratif bir yalan hâline geliyor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kimse onu güncellemez çünkü zorlayıcıdır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yeni gelenler ona dayanır ve hatalar yapar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/probleme-diagrammes-obsoletes.svg&quot; alt=&quot;probleme diagrammes obsoletes&quot; width=&quot;742&quot; height=&quot;418&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soru &lt;em&gt;şema gerekir mi ?&lt;/em&gt; — herkes evet bilir. Soru :&lt;strong&gt;Onları güncel kim tutar?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cevap: kimse. Otomatik olduğu zaman.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çözüm_bir_deterministik_pipeline_knowledge_graph_plantuml&quot;&gt;Çözüm : bir deterministik pipeline Knowledge Graph → PlantUML&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prinsip basittir : Diagramleri elle çizmek yerine, onları&lt;strong&gt;gerçek kod yapısından üretir&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/pipeline-complet.svg&quot; alt=&quot;pipeline complet&quot; width=&quot;1333&quot; height=&quot;434&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İki komut. Sadece.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Étape 1 : extraire le Knowledge Graph
graphify . --no-viz

# Étape 2 : générer les diagrammes PlantUML
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç ? Dosyalar`.puml` et &lt;code&gt;.png`içinde`diagrams/knowledge-graph/&lt;/code&gt;, Git&amp;#8217;te versiyon kontrolü altında, kodla her zaman güncel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_adım_1_graphifyi_yükleyin_ve_knowledge_graphi_çıkarın&quot;&gt;Adım 1: Graphify&amp;#8217;i yükleyin ve Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;i çıkarın&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kurulum&quot;&gt;Kurulum&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphify, kod tabanınızı analiz eden ve yapılandırılmış bir bilgi grafiği oluşturan bir Python aracıdır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Méthode recommandée
uv tool install graphifyy &amp;amp;&amp;amp; graphify install --platform opencode

# Alternative avec pip
pip install graphifyy &amp;amp;&amp;amp; graphify install --platform opencode&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_istisnaları_yapılandır&quot;&gt;Istisnaları yapılandır&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dosya oluştur`.graphifyignore`proje kök dizininde, iş mantığının bir parçası olmayan dosyaları dışlamak için :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-gitignore hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;gitignore&quot;&gt;# Secrets — JAMAIS dans le graphe
*-context.yml
*.env

# Fichiers générés
build/
.gradle/

# Tests fonctionnels
src/functionalTest/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_knowledge_graphı_çıkarma&quot;&gt;Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ı çıkarma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;graphify . --no-viz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;bayrak`--no-viz`HTML üretimini atlar (Gradle pipeline&amp;#8217;ında gereksiz). Sonuç bir dosya.`graphify-out/graph.json`içeren :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;düğümler&lt;/strong&gt;sınıflar, fonksiyonlar, dosyalar — tipi ve topluluğu ile&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kenarlar&lt;/strong&gt;düğümler arasındaki ilişkiler (EXTRACTED koddan, INFERRED LLM tarafından)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;topluluklar&lt;/strong&gt;bağlı düğümlerin otomatik gruplamaları&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Yapı örneği`graph.json`&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-json hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;json&quot;&gt;{
  &quot;nodes&quot;: [
    {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;0&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;LlmService&quot;, &quot;file_type&quot;: &quot;code&quot;, &quot;community&quot;: 0},
    {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;ApiKeyPool&quot;, &quot;file_type&quot;: &quot;code&quot;, &quot;community&quot;: 0},
    {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;2&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;PlantumlService&quot;, &quot;file_type&quot;: &quot;code&quot;, &quot;community&quot;: 1}
  ],
  &quot;links&quot;: [
    {&quot;source&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;0&quot;, &quot;relation&quot;: &quot;uses&quot;, &quot;confidence&quot;: &quot;EXTRACTED&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.9},
    {&quot;source&quot;: &quot;0&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;2&quot;, &quot;relation&quot;: &quot;calls&quot;, &quot;confidence&quot;: &quot;INFERRED&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.7}
  ]
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaynak kod (&lt;code&gt;.kt&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;.java&lt;/code&gt;) yerel olarak tree-sitter tarafından analiz edilir,&lt;strong&gt;çağrı olmadan LLM&lt;/strong&gt;. Sadece belge dosyaları (&lt;code&gt;.adoc&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;.md&lt;/code&gt;) bir LLM çağrısı semantik çıkarma için gerektirir. Dolayısıyla`--update`Kotlin kodunu tarama hemen hemen anıktır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_adım_2_gradle_eklentisi_knowledge_graphü_plantumle_dönüştürür&quot;&gt;Adım 2: Gradle eklentisi, Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ü PlantUML&amp;#8217;e dönüştürür.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_pipeline_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Pipeline mimarisi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti`com.cheroliv.plantuml`Bir görevi entegre eder`generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram`dönüştürür`graph.json`PlantUML diyagramlarında biçiminde&lt;strong&gt;tamamen deterministik&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/architecture-pipeline-kg.svg&quot; alt=&quot;architecture pipeline kg&quot; width=&quot;1109&quot; height=&quot;450&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇ç_bileşenler&quot;&gt;İç bileşenler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Bileşen&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;rol&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphParser&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Ayrıştır`graph.json`— destekler 3 formatlar : graphify yerel (&lt;code&gt;nodes&lt;/code&gt;(Empty output)&lt;code&gt;links&lt;/code&gt;), miras (&lt;code&gt;communities&lt;/code&gt;), düz. Çözer IDs sayısal etiket olarak.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphRenderer&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Deterministik şekilde bir`KnowledgeGraph`PlantUML kodunda. Tiplere göre gruplar, Paketlerdeki topluluklar, Otomatik legend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;GenerateKnowledgeGraphDiagramTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Gradle görevi, parse → render → validate → PNG akışını düzenler. Gradle özellikleri aracılığıyla yapılandırılabilir.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kgmodels.kt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Veri modelleri :`KnowledgeGraph`, &lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphNode&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphEdge&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphCommunity&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;EdgeType&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;PlantumlService&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Söz dizimi doğrulama + PNG oluşturma (eklentinin tüm görevleri tarafından yeniden kullanılır).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_görüntüleme_kuralları&quot;&gt;Görüntüleme kuralları&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Renderer, deterministik görsel kurallarını uygular:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kenar tipi&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;PlantUML notasyonu&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Anlam&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Çıkarılmış&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;-&amp;#8594;&lt;/code&gt;(sabit çizgi, siyah)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kaynak koddan çıkarılmış ilişki (kesinlik)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;INFERRED&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;..&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;(noktalı çizgi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;LLM tarafından çıkarılan ilişki (güven skoru)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;AMBIGUOUS&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;--x&lt;/code&gt;(kırmızı noktalı çizgi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Belirsiz ilişki (doğrulanmalı)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Topluluklar, otomatik renk paleti olan PlantUML paketleri olarak gösterilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_adım_3_günlük_kullanım&quot;&gt;Adım 3: Günlük kullanım&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tam_diyagram&quot;&gt;Tam diyagram&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Générer le diagramme du Knowledge Graph complet
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çıktı :`diagrams/knowledge-graph/knowledge-graph-full.puml`+&lt;code&gt;.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_topluluk_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Topluluk göre filtrele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Une seule communauté
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.community=community_0

# Limiter le nombre de noeuds (lisibilité)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.community=community_0 \
  -Pplantuml.kg.maxNodes=15&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kenar_tipine_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Kenar tipine göre filtrele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Uniquement les relations certaines (EXTRACTED)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.edgeTypes=EXTRACTED

# Relations certaines + inférées
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.edgeTypes=EXTRACTED,INFERRED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_düğüm_tipi_ve_güvene_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Düğüm tipi ve güvene göre filtrele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Uniquement les classes de code
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.nodeTypes=code

# Seuil de confiance minimum (pour les INFERRED)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.minConfidence=0.7&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_özel_çıktı_dizini&quot;&gt;Özel Çıktı Dizini&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.outputDir=docs/architecture&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_özelliklerin_tam_referansı&quot;&gt;Özelliklerin tam referansı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Mülk&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Hata&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Açıklama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.community&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;(hepsi)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İsme göre filtrele (alt dize eşleşmesi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.edgeTypes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;(hepsi)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Virgüllerle ayrılmış kenar tipleri:`EXTRACTED`, &lt;code&gt;INFERRED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AMBIGUOUS&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.minConfidence&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;0.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kenarlar için minimum güven eşiği&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.maxNodes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;(sınırsız)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Maksimum gösterilecek düğüm sayısı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.nodeTypes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;(hepsi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Virgülle ayrılmış düğüm türleri (örnek`class`, &lt;code&gt;code&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.outputDir&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;diagrams/knowledge-graph&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Dosyalar için çıktı dizini`.puml` et &lt;code&gt;.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bir_gradle_workflowundaky_tam_pipeline&quot;&gt;Bir Gradle workflow&amp;#8217;undaky tam pipeline&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇ş_akışı_tipi&quot;&gt;İş akışı tipi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/workflow-complet.svg&quot; alt=&quot;workflow complet&quot; width=&quot;618&quot; height=&quot;714&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_geliştirme_döngüsü_entegrasyonu&quot;&gt;Geliştirme döngüsü entegrasyonu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline, geliştirmenin ana aşamalarına doğal bir şekilde entegre olur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/cycle-developpement.svg&quot; alt=&quot;cycle developpement&quot; width=&quot;699&quot; height=&quot;454&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_artımlı_güncelleme&quot;&gt;Artımlı güncelleme&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kod değiştiğinde, tüm grafiği sıfırdan yeniden oluşturmamız gerekmez:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Mise à jour incrémentale (fichiers modifiés uniquement)
graphify . --update

# Puis régénérer les diagrammes
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;--update`sadece değiştirilmiş dosyaları yeniden çıkarır (SHA256 ile algılanan`graphify-out/cache/&lt;/code&gt;) Kotlin kodunda, tree-sitter yerel olarak çalıştığı için bir LLM çağrısı yapmadan hemen hemen anlık olur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_dogfooding_eklenti_kendi_belgesini_yazar&quot;&gt;Dogfooding: Eklenti kendi belgesini yazar.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PlantUML eklentisi, prompt&amp;#8217;ları diyagramlara dönüştürmek için vardır. Ayrıca kendi &lt;em&gt;kendi&lt;/em&gt; kod tabanının Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ını da dokümantasyon diyagramlarına dönüştürebilir. Bu &lt;em&gt;dogfooding&lt;/em&gt;: eklenti kendi hizmetini tüketir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/dogfooding-pipeline.svg&quot; alt=&quot;dogfooding pipeline&quot; width=&quot;1039&quot; height=&quot;533&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İlgili Gradle görevleri:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Görev&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;LLM ?&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Açıklama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Dönüştür`graph.json`PlantUML&amp;#8217;de (deterministik)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;generateDiagramDocs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Evet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Oluştur`.prompt`Grafikten beri, bunları LLM üzerinden ele alır (dogfooding)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Documentation déterministe (rapide, pas de LLM)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram

# Documentation LLM (plus riche, consomme des tokens)
./gradlew generateDiagramDocs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_neden_determinist_olduğu_ve_neden_önemli&quot;&gt;Neden determinist olduğu (ve neden önemli)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipelinanın ana noktası`generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram`:&lt;strong&gt;O hiçbir LLM çağırmıyor.&lt;/strong&gt;. dönüşüm`graph.json`PlantUML bir saf fonksiyondur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/determinisme-vs-llm.svg&quot; alt=&quot;determinisme vs llm&quot; width=&quot;951&quot; height=&quot;405&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Somut avantajlar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;avantaj&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Etki&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yeniden üretilebilirlik&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;bile`graph.json`→ aynı diyagram. Aynen. Her volta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sıfır maliyet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;LLM çağrısı yok = token yok = API fatura yok&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sıfır gecikme&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Parse + render ~100ms sürer, 1-5 saniye değil.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;CI uyumlu&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;API anahtarı gerekmez. Değişken LLM yanıtı kaynaklı kararsız test yok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;versiyonlanabilir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Le &lt;code&gt;.puml`oluşturulmuş bir metin. Bunu yapabilir`diff&lt;/code&gt;, PR&amp;#8217;deki gözden geçiren, Git&amp;#8217;te sürümlemek.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_pipelinenin_kendi_diyagramları&quot;&gt;Pipelinenin kendi diyagramları&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İşte eklenti tarafından oluşturulacağı şekilde pipeline diyagramı:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/pipeline-sequence.svg&quot; alt=&quot;pipeline sequence&quot; width=&quot;1682&quot; height=&quot;554&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_proje_yönetimine_entegrasyon&quot;&gt;Proje yönetimine entegrasyon&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projemizde, bu pipeline, yapay zeka ajanı için EAGER/LAZY bağlam yönetimi stratejisine entegre edilir. Knowledge Graph, el ile hazırlanmış mimari dokümantasyonu yerleştirip yerine yapılandırılmış, sorgulanabilir ve otomatik güncellenebilen bir grafiğe dönüştürür.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/strategie-hybride.svg&quot; alt=&quot;strategie hybride&quot; width=&quot;2011&quot; height=&quot;240&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İki sistemin birleşimi tamamlayıcıdır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strateji ne zaman ve nasıl olduğu yönünden sorumludur&lt;/strong&gt;— yönetim, iş akışı, arşivleme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graphify QUOI ve OÜ yönetir&lt;/strong&gt;kod yapısı, ilişkiler, hedefli sorgular&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(blank)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But outputting nothing could be ambiguous. Maybe better to output same placeholder if it&amp;#8217;s considered input? No, the placeholder is in instruction, not source. Probably they intend you to wait for text, but since they didn&amp;#8217;t include any, returning nothing is safest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thus final answer: no content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;#8217;ll output nothing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;/think&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(nothing) Oturum stratejisi yönetir le&lt;strong&gt;Ne zaman&lt;/strong&gt; et le &lt;strong&gt;nasıl&lt;/strong&gt;(yönetim, iş akışı, eşikler), Graphify yönetir&lt;strong&gt;ne&lt;/strong&gt; et le &lt;strong&gt;Nerede&lt;/strong&gt;(kod yapısı, ilişkiler, hedefli sorguları). PlantUML boru hattı&lt;strong&gt;neyle&lt;/strong&gt;(deterministik diyagramlar, versiyonlanmış, her zaman güncel) (empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_hazırlık_5_dakikalık_kontrol_listesi&quot;&gt;Hazırlık : 5 dakikalık kontrol listesi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;#&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Aşama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;sipariş&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Graphify&amp;#8217;i kurun&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv tool install graphifyy&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Istisnaları yapılandır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Oluştur`.graphifyignore`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;i çıkarmak&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;graphify . --no-viz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Diyagramları oluştur&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sonuçları kaydedin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;git add diagrams/knowledge-graph/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Script complet en 5 commandes
uv tool install graphifyy
cat &amp;gt; .graphifyignore &amp;lt;&amp;lt; &#39;EOF&#39;
*-context.yml
*.env
build/
.gradle/
EOF
graphify . --no-viz
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram
git add graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.adoc graphify-out/graph.json diagrams/knowledge-graph/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_delikler_ve_azaltmalar&quot;&gt;Delikler ve Azaltmalar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Tuzak&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Açıklama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Azaltma&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Çok yoğun grafik&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Bir büyük proje yüzlerce okunamaz düğüm üretir.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kullanmak`-Pplantuml.kg.maxNodes=30`ve toplulukça filtrele&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Aşırı geniş dışlamalar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Çok fazla dosya içinde`.graphifyignore`grafiğin değerini azaltır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İlk olarak sadece kimlik bilgileri ve derlemeyi dışarıda bırak.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Ok yönleri&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;INFERRED kenarlar yönü belirsiz olabilir.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Göre filtrele`-Pplantuml.kg.edgeTypes=EXTRACTED`Yalnızca belirli ilişkiler için&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Eski grafik&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kod değişir ancak grafik yeniden oluşturulmaz.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;kullanmak`graphify . --update`düzenli olarak veya git hook`graphify hook install`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Güncellenmiş maliyet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Artımlı güncellemeler neredeyse ücretsizdir (yerel tree-sitter)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sadece belgeler (&lt;code&gt;.adoc&lt;/code&gt;) LLM tokenlarını tüketirler&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuçta_elde_ettiğimiz_şey&quot;&gt;Sonuçta elde ettiğimiz şey&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/recap-visuel.svg&quot; alt=&quot;recap visuel&quot; width=&quot;350&quot; height=&quot;258&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Somut faydalar :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kâr&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Detay&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Her zaman güncel dokümantasyon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Diagramlar güncel kodu yansıtır, el ile alınan bir anlık görüntü değil&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sıfır bakım çabası&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Diyagramlar her derlemede yeniden oluşturulur.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Teknik borç azaltımı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Artık diagramları elle korumaya gerek yok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yeniler için görsel bağlam&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yeni bir geliştirici, diyagramlara bakarak mimariyi anlar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Olası ince ayar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Çiftler (alt‑grafik → diyagram) yapay zeka eğitimi örnekleridir.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Otomatik doğrulama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`PlantumlService.validateSyntax()`Her oluşturulan diyagramı kontrol et&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hızlı onboarding&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;5 diyagram = mimarinin tamamının görünümü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;__&lt;/em&gt; Kimse &lt;em&gt;nedeni&lt;/em&gt; varsa tüm &lt;em&gt;nasıl&lt;/em&gt; larına dayanabilir (No output – empty response.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;pourquoi&lt;/em&gt; : her zaman güncel diyagramlar. &lt;em&gt;comment&lt;/em&gt; : bir Gradle pipeline&amp;#8217;ında iki komut.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bağlantılar&quot;&gt;Bağlantılar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nicholasgasior/graphify&quot;&gt;GitHub&amp;#8217;da Graphify&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cheroliv/plantuml-gradle&quot;&gt;PlantUML Gradle Eklentisi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/blog/2026/0104_fg_command_super_tips_post.html&quot;&gt;fg komutu için harika ipuçları&lt;/a&gt;— terminal workflow hakkında önceki makale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;İçindekiler&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sorun_kodun_her_zaman_gerisinde_kalan_diyagramlar&quot;&gt;Sorun: kodun her zaman gerisinde kalan diyagramlar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_çözüm_deterministik_bir_knowledge_graph_plantuml_hattı&quot;&gt;Çözüm: deterministik bir Knowledge Graph → PlantUML hattı&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_adım_1_graphifyı_yükleyin_ve_knowledge_graphı_dışa_aktarın&quot;&gt;Adım 1: Graphify&amp;#8217;ı yükleyin ve Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ı dışa aktarın&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_kurulum&quot;&gt;Kurulum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_hariç_tutmaları_yapılandır&quot;&gt;Hariç tutmaları yapılandır&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_knowledge_graphu_çıkart&quot;&gt;Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;u Çıkart&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_adım_2_gradle_eklentisi_bilgi_grafiğini_knowledge_graph_plantumle_dönüştürür&quot;&gt;Adım 2: Gradle eklentisi Bilgi Grafiğini (Knowledge Graph) PlantUML&amp;#8217;e dönüştürür&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_boru_hattı_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Boru hattı mimarisi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_dahili_bileşenler&quot;&gt;Dahili bileşenler&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_i̇şleme_kuralları&quot;&gt;İşleme kuralları&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_adım_3_günlük_kullanım&quot;&gt;Adım 3: Günlük Kullanım&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_tam_diyagram&quot;&gt;Tam diyagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_topluluğa_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Topluluğa göre filtrele&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_kenar_tipine_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Kenar tipine göre filtrele&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_düğüm_türüne_ve_güvene_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Düğüm türüne ve güvene göre filtrele&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_özel_çıktı_dizini&quot;&gt;Özel çıktı dizini&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_özelliklerin_tam_referansı&quot;&gt;Özelliklerin tam referansı&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_bir_gradle_iş_akışındaki_eksiksiz_pipeline&quot;&gt;Bir Gradle iş akışındaki eksiksiz pipeline&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_i̇ş_akışı_türü&quot;&gt;İş akışı türü&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_geliştirme_döngüsüne_entegrasyon&quot;&gt;Geliştirme döngüsüne entegrasyon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_artımlı_güncelleme&quot;&gt;Artımlı güncelleme&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_dogfooding_eklenti_kendi_kendini_belgelendiriyor&quot;&gt;Dogfooding: eklenti kendi kendini belgelendiriyor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_neden_deterministiktir_ve_neden_önemlidir&quot;&gt;Neden deterministiktir (ve neden önemlidir)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_pipelineın_kendi_diyagramları&quot;&gt;Pipeline&amp;#8217;ın kendi diyagramları&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_proje_yönetişimine_entegrasyon&quot;&gt;Proje yönetişimine entegrasyon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_hazırlık_5_dakikalık_kontrol_listesi&quot;&gt;Hazırlık: 5 dakikalık kontrol listesi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_tuzaklar_ve_hafifletmeler&quot;&gt;Tuzaklar ve hafifletmeler&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sonuçta_elde_ettiğimiz_şey&quot;&gt;Sonuçta elde ettiğimiz şey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_bağlantılar&quot;&gt;Bağlantılar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi: 12 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kod tabanınız büyüyor. Modüller arasındaki bağımlılıklar artıyor. Mimari dokümantasyon, daha yazılmadan güncelliğini yitiriyor. Ya Gradle build işleminiz, kodun gerçek yapısından yola çıkarak &lt;em&gt;otomatik olarak&lt;/em&gt; güncel diyagramlar oluşturabilseydi? Graphify + PlantUML Gradle Plugin hattının yaptığı tam olarak budur:`graphify . --no-viz`Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ı çıkarır,`./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram`onu PlantUML diyagramlarına dönüştürür. Sıfır LLM, sıfır manuel, %100 deterministik.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;içindekiler&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- toc disabled --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun_kodun_her_zaman_gerisinde_kalan_diyagramlar&quot;&gt;Sorun: kodun her zaman gerisinde kalan diyagramlar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Birkaç bin satırı aşan her proje bu sendromu yaşar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projenin başında bir mimari diyagram çizilir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kod gelişir, bağımlılıklar değişir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diyagram dekoratif bir yalana dönüşüyor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kimse güncellemiyor çünkü çok zahmetli&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yeni gelenler buna dayanıyor ve hatalar yapıyorlar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/probleme-diagrammes-obsoletes.svg&quot; alt=&quot;probleme diagrammes obsoletes&quot; width=&quot;893&quot; height=&quot;418&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soru &lt;em&gt;diyagramlara gerek var mı?&lt;/em&gt; değil — herkes bunun cevabının evet olduğunu biliyor. Soru şu:&lt;strong&gt;onları güncel tutan kim?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cevap: hiç kimse. Otomatik değilse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çözüm_deterministik_bir_knowledge_graph_plantuml_hattı&quot;&gt;Çözüm: deterministik bir Knowledge Graph → PlantUML hattı&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prensip basit: diyagramları elle çizmek yerine, onları&lt;strong&gt;kodun gerçek yapısından oluşturulur&lt;/strong&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/pipeline-complet.svg&quot; alt=&quot;pipeline complet&quot; width=&quot;1265&quot; height=&quot;434&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İki komut. Hepsi bu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Étape 1 : extraire le Knowledge Graph
graphify . --no-viz

# Étape 2 : générer les diagrammes PlantUML
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç mu? Dosyalar`.puml` et &lt;code&gt;.png`içinde`diagrams/knowledge-graph/&lt;/code&gt;, Git&amp;#8217;de versiyonlanmış ve her zaman kodla güncel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_adım_1_graphifyı_yükleyin_ve_knowledge_graphı_dışa_aktarın&quot;&gt;Adım 1: Graphify&amp;#8217;ı yükleyin ve Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;ı dışa aktarın&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kurulum&quot;&gt;Kurulum&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphify, kod tabanınızı analiz eden ve yapılandırılmış bir bilgi grafiği oluşturan bir Python aracıdır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Méthode recommandée
uv tool install graphifyy &amp;amp;&amp;amp; graphify install --platform opencode

# Alternative avec pip
pip install graphifyy &amp;amp;&amp;amp; graphify install --platform opencode&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_hariç_tutmaları_yapılandır&quot;&gt;Hariç tutmaları yapılandır&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir dosya oluşturun`.graphifyignore`iş mantığının bir parçası olmayan dosyaları hariç tutmak için proje kökünde:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-gitignore hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;gitignore&quot;&gt;# Secrets — JAMAIS dans le graphe
*-context.yml
*.env

# Fichiers générés
build/
.gradle/

# Tests fonctionnels
src/functionalTest/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_knowledge_graphu_çıkart&quot;&gt;Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;u Çıkart&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;graphify . --no-viz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bayrak`--no-viz`HTML oluşturma adımını atlar (Gradle hattında gereksizdir). Sonuç bir dosyadır`graphify-out/graph.json`içeren:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Düğümler&lt;/strong&gt;: sınıflar, fonksiyonlar, dosyalar — türleri ve topluluklarıyla birlikte&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kenarlar&lt;/strong&gt;: düğümler arası ilişkiler (koddan ÇIKARILMIŞ, LLM tarafından ÇIKARIMSAL olarak belirlenmiş)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Topluluklar&lt;/strong&gt;: bağlı düğümlerin otomatik gruplandırılması&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Yapı örneği`graph.json`&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-json hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;json&quot;&gt;{
  &quot;nodes&quot;: [
    {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;0&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;LlmService&quot;, &quot;file_type&quot;: &quot;code&quot;, &quot;community&quot;: 0},
    {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;ApiKeyPool&quot;, &quot;file_type&quot;: &quot;code&quot;, &quot;community&quot;: 0},
    {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;2&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;PlantumlService&quot;, &quot;file_type&quot;: &quot;code&quot;, &quot;community&quot;: 1}
  ],
  &quot;links&quot;: [
    {&quot;source&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;0&quot;, &quot;relation&quot;: &quot;uses&quot;, &quot;confidence&quot;: &quot;EXTRACTED&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.9},
    {&quot;source&quot;: &quot;0&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;2&quot;, &quot;relation&quot;: &quot;calls&quot;, &quot;confidence&quot;: &quot;INFERRED&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 0.7}
  ]
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaynak kodu (&lt;code&gt;.kt&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;.java&lt;/code&gt;) tree-sitter tarafından yerel olarak analiz edilir,&lt;strong&gt;kesin LLM&lt;/strong&gt;. Yalnızca dokümantasyon dosyaları (&lt;code&gt;.adoc&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;.md&lt;/code&gt;) anlamsal çıkarım için bir LLM çağrısı gerektirir. Bu nedenle`--update`Kotlin kodu üzerinde neredeyse anlıktır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_adım_2_gradle_eklentisi_bilgi_grafiğini_knowledge_graph_plantumle_dönüştürür&quot;&gt;Adım 2: Gradle eklentisi Bilgi Grafiğini (Knowledge Graph) PlantUML&amp;#8217;e dönüştürür&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_boru_hattı_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Boru hattı mimarisi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti`com.cheroliv.plantuml`bir görev entegre eder`generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram`dönüştüren`graph.json`PlantUML diyagramlarına şu şekilde&lt;strong&gt;tamamen deterministik&lt;/strong&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni girin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/architecture-pipeline-kg.svg&quot; alt=&quot;architecture pipeline kg&quot; width=&quot;1109&quot; height=&quot;450&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_dahili_bileşenler&quot;&gt;Dahili bileşenler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Bileşen&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Rol&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphParser&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Ayrıştır`graph.json`— 3 formatı destekler: yerel graphify (&lt;code&gt;nodes&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;links&lt;/code&gt;), eski (&lt;code&gt;communities&lt;/code&gt;), flat. Sayısal ID&amp;#8217;leri etiketlere çözer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphRenderer&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Deterministik olarak bir &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&#39;ya dönüştürür`KnowledgeGraph`PlantUML kodunda. Türe göre gruplandırılmış, paketler halinde topluluklar ve otomatik lejant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;GenerateKnowledgeGraphDiagramTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Orkestrasyon yapan Gradle görevi: parse → render → validate → PNG. Gradle özellikleri aracılığıyla yapılandırılabilir.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kgmodels.kt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Veri modelleri:`KnowledgeGraph`, &lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphNode&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphEdge&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;KnowledgeGraphCommunity&lt;/code&gt;, `EdgeType`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;PlantumlService&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sözdizimi doğrulaması + PNG çıktısı (eklentinin tüm görevleri tarafından yeniden kullanılır).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇şleme_kuralları&quot;&gt;İşleme kuralları&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İşleyici belirleyici görsel kurallar uygular:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kenar tipi&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;PlantUML Notasyonu&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Anlam&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;ÇIKARILMIŞ&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;-&amp;#8594;&lt;/code&gt;(düz çizgi, siyah)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kaynak koddan çıkarılan ilişki (kesinlik)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;ÇIKARILMIŞ&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;..&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;(kesikli çizgi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;LLM tarafından çıkarılan ilişki (güven puanı)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;BELİRSİZ&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;--x&lt;/code&gt;(kırmızı noktalı çizgi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Belirsiz ilişki (kontrol edilmeli)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Topluluklar, otomatik bir renk paleti ile PlantUML paketleri olarak döndürülür.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_adım_3_günlük_kullanım&quot;&gt;Adım 3: Günlük Kullanım&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tam_diyagram&quot;&gt;Tam diyagram&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Générer le diagramme du Knowledge Graph complet
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çıktı:`diagrams/knowledge-graph/knowledge-graph-full.puml`+&lt;code&gt;.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_topluluğa_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Topluluğa göre filtrele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Une seule communauté
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.community=community_0

# Limiter le nombre de noeuds (lisibilité)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.community=community_0 \
  -Pplantuml.kg.maxNodes=15&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kenar_tipine_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Kenar tipine göre filtrele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Uniquement les relations certaines (EXTRACTED)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.edgeTypes=EXTRACTED

# Relations certaines + inférées
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.edgeTypes=EXTRACTED,INFERRED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_düğüm_türüne_ve_güvene_göre_filtrele&quot;&gt;Düğüm türüne ve güvene göre filtrele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Uniquement les classes de code
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.nodeTypes=code

# Seuil de confiance minimum (pour les INFERRED)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.minConfidence=0.7&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_özel_çıktı_dizini&quot;&gt;Özel çıktı dizini&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram \
  -Pplantuml.kg.outputDir=docs/architecture&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_özelliklerin_tam_referansı&quot;&gt;Özelliklerin tam referansı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Mülkiyet&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Hata&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Açıklama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.community&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;(tümü)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Toplulukları isme göre filtrele (alt dize eşleşmesi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.edgeTypes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;(tümü)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Virgülle ayrılmış kenar türleri:`EXTRACTED`, &lt;code&gt;INFERRED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AMBIGUOUS&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.minConfidence&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;0.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kenarlar için minimum güven eşiği&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.maxNodes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;(sınırsız)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Görüntülenecek maksimum düğüm sayısı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.nodeTypes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;(tümü)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Virgülle ayrılmış düğüm türleri (örn.&lt;code&gt;class&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;code&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;plantuml.kg.outputDir&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;diagrams/knowledge-graph&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Dosyalar için çıktı dizini`.puml` et &lt;code&gt;.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bir_gradle_iş_akışındaki_eksiksiz_pipeline&quot;&gt;Bir Gradle iş akışındaki eksiksiz pipeline&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇ş_akışı_türü&quot;&gt;İş akışı türü&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/workflow-complet.svg&quot; alt=&quot;workflow complet&quot; width=&quot;618&quot; height=&quot;714&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_geliştirme_döngüsüne_entegrasyon&quot;&gt;Geliştirme döngüsüne entegrasyon&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline, geliştirmenin temel aşamalarına doğal olarak entegre olur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/cycle-developpement.svg&quot; alt=&quot;cycle developpement&quot; width=&quot;743&quot; height=&quot;454&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_artımlı_güncelleme&quot;&gt;Artımlı güncelleme&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kod değiştiğinde, tüm grafik sıfırdan yeniden oluşturulmaz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Mise à jour incrémentale (fichiers modifiés uniquement)
graphify . --update

# Puis régénérer les diagrammes
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;--update`yalnızca değiştirilen dosyaları yeniden çıkarır (SHA256 ile tespit edilenler içindeki`graphify-out/cache/&lt;/code&gt;). Kotlin kodunda, tree-sitter LLM çağrısı yapmadan yerel olarak çalıştığı için bu işlem neredeyse anlıktır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_dogfooding_eklenti_kendi_kendini_belgelendiriyor&quot;&gt;Dogfooding: eklenti kendi kendini belgelendiriyor&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PlantUML eklentisi, istemleri diyagramlara dönüştürmek için mevcuttur. Ayrıca kendi kod tabanının Bilgi Grafiğini (Knowledge Graph) dokümantasyon diyagramlarına dönüştürebilir. Bu bir &lt;em&gt;dogfooding&lt;/em&gt; örneğidir: eklenti kendi hizmetini tüketmektedir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/dogfooding-pipeline.svg&quot; alt=&quot;dogfooding pipeline&quot; width=&quot;1022&quot; height=&quot;533&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İlişkili Gradle görevleri:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Görev&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;LLM ?&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Açıklama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Dönüştür`graph.json`PlantUML ile (deterministik)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;generateDiagramDocs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Evet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Oluşturun`.prompt`grafikten, bunları LLM aracılığıyla işler (dogfooding)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Documentation déterministe (rapide, pas de LLM)
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram

# Documentation LLM (plus riche, consomme des tokens)
./gradlew generateDiagramDocs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_neden_deterministiktir_ve_neden_önemlidir&quot;&gt;Neden deterministiktir (ve neden önemlidir)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline&amp;#8217;ın kilit noktası`generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram`Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;strong&gt;hiçbir LLM çağırmaz&lt;/strong&gt;. Dönüşüm`graph.json`→ PlantUML saf bir fonksiyondur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/determinisme-vs-llm.svg&quot; alt=&quot;determinisme vs llm&quot; width=&quot;927&quot; height=&quot;405&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Somut avantajlar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Avantaj&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Etki&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Tekrarlanabilirlik&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hatta`graph.json`→ aynı diyagram. Kesinlikle. Her seferinde.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sıfır maliyet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;LLM çağrısı yok = token yok = API faturası yok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sıfır gecikme&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Parse + render ~100ms sürer, 1-5 saniye değil.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Uyumlu CI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;API anahtarı gerekli değil. Değişken bir LLM yanıtından kaynaklanan tutarsız (flaky) test yok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Versiyonlanabilir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Le &lt;code&gt;.puml`üretilen metindir. Onu`diff&lt;/code&gt;, PR inceleyen kişiyi, Git ile versiyonlamayı.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_pipelineın_kendi_diyagramları&quot;&gt;Pipeline&amp;#8217;ın kendi diyagramları&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Döngüyü tamamlamak için, eklenti tarafından oluşturulacağı şekliyle pipeline diyagramı şöyledir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/pipeline-sequence.svg&quot; alt=&quot;pipeline sequence&quot; width=&quot;1682&quot; height=&quot;554&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_proje_yönetişimine_entegrasyon&quot;&gt;Proje yönetişimine entegrasyon&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projemizde, bu pipeline, yapay zeka ajanı için bir EAGER/LAZY bağlam yönetim stratejisine entegre olmaktadır. Knowledge Graph, manuel mimari dokümantasyonun yerini yapılandırılmış, sorgulanabilir ve otomatik olarak güncellenen bir grafik ile almaktadır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/strategie-hybride.svg&quot; alt=&quot;strategie hybride&quot; width=&quot;2037&quot; height=&quot;240&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İki sistemin evliliği tamamlayıcıdır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strateji NE ZAMAN ve NASIL sorularını yönetir&lt;/strong&gt;— yönetişim, iş akışı, arşivleme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graphify, NEYİ ve NEREYİ yönetir&lt;/strong&gt;— kod yapısı, ilişkiler, hedeflenmiş sorgular&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın. Oturum stratejisi şunları yönetir:&lt;strong&gt;NE ZAMAN&lt;/strong&gt; et le &lt;strong&gt;YORUM&lt;/strong&gt;(yönetişim, iş akışı, eşikler), Graphify şunları yönetir:&lt;strong&gt;NE&lt;/strong&gt; et le &lt;strong&gt;NEREDE&lt;/strong&gt;(kod yapısı, ilişkiler, hedeflenmiş sorgular). PlantUML hattı şunu yönetir:&lt;strong&gt;NE İLE&lt;/strong&gt;(deterministik, versiyonlanmış ve her zaman güncel diyagramlar). Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_hazırlık_5_dakikalık_kontrol_listesi&quot;&gt;Hazırlık: 5 dakikalık kontrol listesi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Profesyonel bir çevirmensin. Fransızcadan Türkçeye çevir.
Tüm ters tırnaklı kod alanlarını (&lt;code&gt;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&lt;/code&gt;) olduğu gibi koru; ters tırnak içeriğini, boşluklarını veya konumunu asla değiştirme.
Bu metin daha büyük bir cümlenin parçası olabilir; bağlam istemeden parçayı çevir.
Yalnızca çevrilmiş metni çıktıla; açıklama, yorum, giriş, alternatifler veya seçenekler ekleme.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Adım&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sipariş&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Graphify&amp;#8217;ı Kurun&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv tool install graphifyy&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İstisnaları yapılandır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Oluştur`.graphifyignore`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Knowledge Graph&amp;#8217;u ayıkla&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;graphify . --no-viz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Diyagramları oluştur&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sonuçları commit et&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;git add diagrams/knowledge-graph/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Script complet en 5 commandes
uv tool install graphifyy
cat &amp;gt; .graphifyignore &amp;lt;&amp;lt; &#39;EOF&#39;
*-context.yml
*.env
build/
.gradle/
EOF
graphify . --no-viz
./gradlew generateKnowledgeGraphDiagram
git add graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.adoc graphify-out/graph.json diagrams/knowledge-graph/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_tuzaklar_ve_hafifletmeler&quot;&gt;Tuzaklar ve hafifletmeler&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3334%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Tuzak&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Açıklama&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Hafifletme&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Grafik çok yoğun&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Büyük bir proje, okunamaz yüzlerce düğüm oluşturur&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kullanmak`-Pplantuml.kg.maxNodes=30`ve topluluğa göre filtrele&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Çok geniş kapsamlı istisnalar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;şuradaki dosya sayısı çok fazla`.graphifyignore`graf değerini azaltır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sadece &lt;code&gt;credentials&lt;/code&gt; ve &lt;code&gt;build&lt;/code&gt; klasörlerini hariç tutarak başlayın&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Ok yönleri&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;INFERRED kenarlar belirsiz bir yöne sahip olabilir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Şuna göre filtrele:`-Pplantuml.kg.edgeTypes=EXTRACTED`yalnızca kesin ilişkiler için&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kullanımdan kaldırılmış grafem&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kod değişiyor ancak grafik yeniden oluşturulmuyor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kullanmak`graphify . --update`düzenli olarak veya &lt;code&gt;git&lt;/code&gt; hook&amp;#8217;u`graphify hook install`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Güncellenmiş maliyet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Artımlı güncellemeler neredeyse ücretsizdir (tree-sitter local)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sadece dokümanlar (&lt;code&gt;.adoc&lt;/code&gt;) LLM tokenleri tüketir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuçta_elde_ettiğimiz_şey&quot;&gt;Sonuçta elde ettiğimiz şey&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/recap-visuel.svg&quot; alt=&quot;recap visuel&quot; width=&quot;346&quot; height=&quot;258&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Somut faydalar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kâr&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Detay&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Her zaman güncel dokümantasyon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Diyagramlar manuel bir anlık görüntüyü değil, mevcut kodu yansıtır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sıfır bakım çabası&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Diyagramlar her build işleminde yeniden oluşturulur&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Teknik borcun azaltılması&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Diyagramları elle tutmaya gerek kalmadı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yeni gelenler için görsel bağlam&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yeni bir geliştirici, diyagramlara bakarak mimariyi anlar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Potansiyel ince ayar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;(alt-grafik → diyagram) çiftleri, yapay zeka eğitim örnekleridir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Otomatik doğrulama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`PlantumlService.validateSyntax()`oluşturulan her diyagramı kontrol et&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hızlı onboarding&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;5 diyagram = mimarinin tam görünümü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın. Bir &lt;em&gt;nedeni&lt;/em&gt; olan, her türlü _nasıl_a katlanabilir. Lütfen çevrilecek metni sağlayın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Neden&lt;/em&gt;: her zaman güncel diyagramlar. &lt;em&gt;Nasıl&lt;/em&gt;: bir Gradle hattında (pipeline) iki komut.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
