&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_özet_diyagram&quot;&gt;Özet diyagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_fg_neden_düşük_tahmin_ediliyor&quot;&gt;Fg neden düşük tahmin ediliyor?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_teknik_not_sinyaller&quot;&gt;Teknik not: sinyaller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_referanslar&quot;&gt;Referanslar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi : 10 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fırlatırsınız`./gradlew build`, terminal 3 dakika boyunca engelleniyor, ve başka bir şey yapmanız gerekiyor &lt;em&gt;beklerken&lt;/em&gt; ? Yeni bir sekme açmaya gerek yok.`Ctrl+Z`İşlemi askıya alır,`fg`Onu tam olarak siz biraktığınız yere geri getirir. Bir geliştiricinin günlük yaşamındaki en az tahmin edilen Unix ipucu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;tik&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- toc disabled --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun_meşgul_bir_terminal&quot;&gt;Sorun: meşgul bir terminal&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her bir geliştirici bu durumu yaşamıştır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Terminal kilitli. Daha fazla komut giremezsiniz. Bir dosyayı görüntülemek ve bir işlemi başlatmak istiyorsunuz.&lt;code&gt;git status&lt;/code&gt;, veya bir portun meşgul olduğunu kontrol etmek.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/terminal-bloque.svg&quot; alt=&quot;terminal bloque&quot; width=&quot;445&quot; height=&quot;378&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çoğu geliştirici yeni bir terminal açar. Ancak daha zarif, daha hızlı ve yerel bir çözüm vardır: iş yönetimi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_üç_zorunlu_komut&quot;&gt;Üç zorunlu komut&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ctrlz_duraklatma_sigtstp&quot;&gt;Ctrl+Z — Duraklatma (SIGTSTP)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`Ctrl+Z`Sinyalı gönder.`SIGTSTP`Ön plan sürecine. Süreç&lt;strong&gt;askıda&lt;/strong&gt;— ölmedi — ve terminal promptunu bulur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew build
$&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Köşeli parantez içindeki sayı`[1]` est le &lt;strong&gt;iş numarası&lt;/strong&gt;. Le `+`Varsayılan işi gösterir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_fg_durdurulan_işi_ön_planda_devam_ettirmek&quot;&gt;fg — Durdurulan işi ön planda devam ettirmek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`fg`Duraklatılmış işi ön plana getirir; işlem tam olarak durduğu yerden devam eder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ fg
./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building... (reprend où il en était)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Belirli bir iş numarasıyla :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ fg %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bg_arka_planda_devam_et&quot;&gt;bg — Arka planda devam et&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`bg`İşlemi terminali bloke etmeden sürdürür. Uzun derlemeler için idealdir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ bg
[1]+ ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
$&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le `&amp;amp;`Sona erdiğinde, sürecin arka planda çalıştığı anlamına gelir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_jobs_shell_işlerini_listele&quot;&gt;jobs — Shell işlerini listele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ jobs
[1]-  Stoppé    vim README.md
[2]+  En cours   ./gradlew build&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/jobs-lifecycle.svg&quot; alt=&quot;jobs lifecycle&quot; width=&quot;551&quot; height=&quot;395&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_1_uzun_derleme&quot;&gt;Senaryo 1: Uzun derleme&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu en yaygın kullanım durumudur. Bir Gradle derlemesi çalıştırıyorsunuz, terminal bloke oluyor ve başka bir şey yapmanız gerekiyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/scenario-build.svg&quot; alt=&quot;scenario build&quot; width=&quot;687&quot; height=&quot;599&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_adım&quot;&gt;Adım adım&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew build

$ git status
On branch main
nothing to commit, working tree clean

$ fg
./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...
BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 2m 34s&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_2_unutulmuş_editör&quot;&gt;Senaryo 2: Unutulmuş editör&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İçerisiniz`vim`, başka bir dosyayı &lt;em&gt;sans&lt;/em&gt; çıkmadan incelemeniz gerekiyor`vim`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Dans vim, en mode commande :
:shell
$ cat /path/to/other/file.txt
$ exit
# Retour dans vim&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ama ağır. İle`Ctrl+Z`, hemen olur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Dans vim, n&#39;importe quel moment :
Ctrl+Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim README.md

$ cat /path/to/other/file.txt
# ... lire le fichier ...

$ fg
vim README.md
# Retour exact là où on en était, curseur en place&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/vim-suspend.svg&quot; alt=&quot;vim suspend&quot; width=&quot;456&quot; height=&quot;510&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;code&gt;vim`Durumu mükemmel şekilde bir [&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;]&#39;den sonra geri yükler`fg&lt;/code&gt;: imleç konumu, tampon içeriği, geri alma geçmişi — her şey korunuyor.
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_3_durdurulan_opencode_süreci&quot;&gt;Senaryo 3: Durdurulan opencode süreci&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu makalenin motivasyonunu sağlayan senaryo budur. Kullanıyorsunuz.&lt;code&gt;opencode&lt;/code&gt;(komut satırı aracı ile kodunuz üzerindeki bir LLM&amp;#8217;yi pilotlamak), ve işlem askıya alındı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/opencode-fg.svg&quot; alt=&quot;opencode fg&quot; width=&quot;451&quot; height=&quot;588&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ opencode
# ... session en cours, LLM analyse le code ...
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    opencode

$ git diff HEAD~1
# vérifier les changements récents

$ fg
opencode
# Le LLM reprend là où il s&#39;était arrêté&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avantaj iki katlıdır :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bağlam kaybı yok&lt;/strong&gt;: LLM oturumu, konuşma geçmişi, açılan dosyalar — her şey korunur&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yeniden başlatma yok&lt;/strong&gt;: opencode&amp;#8217;i yeniden başlatmaya, bağlamı yeniden yüklemeye veya sorunu LLM&amp;#8217;e yeniden açıklamaya gerek yok&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_4_çok_sayıda_işi_aynı_anda_yönetme&quot;&gt;Senaryo 4 : Çok sayıda işi aynı anda yönetme&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; et `bg`Birden fazla süreç askıya alındığında belirli bir süreci hedef almak için bir iş numarası kabul ederler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ vim config.yml
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim config.yml

$ ./gradlew test
^Z
[2]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew test

$ htop
^Z
[3]+  Stoppé    htop

$ jobs
[1]   Stoppé    vim config.yml
[2]-  Stoppé    ./gradlew test
[3]+  Stoppé    htop

$ fg %2
./gradlew test
# Le build reprend en avant-plan

$ bg %3
[3] htop &amp;amp;
# htop reprend en arrière-plan&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/multiple-jobs.svg&quot; alt=&quot;multiple jobs&quot; width=&quot;738&quot; height=&quot;250&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇ş_komutları_özeti&quot;&gt;İş komutları özeti&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 20%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 40%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 40%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;sipariş&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Etki&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Örnek&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Ön plandaki süreci askıya al&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Gönderim`SIGTSTP`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Varsayılan işi ön planda devam ettir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; ou &lt;code&gt;fg %1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İş n&amp;#8217;i öne alın&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Varsayılan işi arka planda sürdürün&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt; ou &lt;code&gt;bg %1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Arka planda n işini devam ettirir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;jobs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Mevcut kabuğun işlerini listele&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;jobs -l&lt;/code&gt;(PID ile)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Tamamla iş n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_fg_bg_ctrlz_ctrlc_ve_arasındaki_farklar&quot;&gt;fg, bg, Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+C ve &amp;amp; arasındaki farklar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çoğu geliştirici bu mekanizmaları karıştırır. İşte net bir açıklama.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/signals-comparison.svg&quot; alt=&quot;signals comparison&quot; width=&quot;1718&quot; height=&quot;244&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 16.6666%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 16.6666%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3335%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kısayol/Komut&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Sinyal&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Etki&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Geriye dön?&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGTSTP&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İşlemi (dondurulmuş, bellekte) askıya alır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Evet :`fg` ou &lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+C&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGINT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İşlemi sonlandır (tamamlandı)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır : süreç yok edildi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+\&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGQUIT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İşlemi öldür + core dump&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır : süreç yok edildi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;commande &amp;amp;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;—&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Arka planda doğrudan başlat&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`fg`öne almak için&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z`dır&lt;strong&gt;zararsız&lt;/strong&gt;. Süreç bellekte olduğu gibi donar. Hemen devam edebilirsiniz`fg&lt;/code&gt;. Bir &lt;em&gt;pause&lt;/em&gt;, bir &lt;em&gt;stop&lt;/em&gt; değil.
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bir_işin_tam_yaşam_döngüsü&quot;&gt;Bir işin tam yaşam döngüsü&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/job-lifecycle-complete.svg&quot; alt=&quot;job lifecycle complete&quot; width=&quot;461&quot; height=&quot;689&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇leri_seviye_ipuçları&quot;&gt;İleri seviye ipuçları&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_fg_ile_en_güncel_iş_ve_alternatif_eğitim&quot;&gt;fg ile en güncel iş ve alternatif eğitim&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg`Argüman olmadan işaretli işi getirir.&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;(en güncel). Ancak kullanabilirsiniz.&lt;/code&gt;%-`önceki işi hedeflemek için :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ vim file1.txt
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim file1.txt

$ vim file2.txt
^Z
[2]+  Stoppé    vim file2.txt

$ fg      # ramène job [2] (le plus récent)
$ fg %-   # ramène job [1] (le précédent)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bir_işi_düzgünce_öldürmek&quot;&gt;bir işi düzgünce öldürmek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ jobs
[1]-  Stoppé    vim config.yml
[2]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew test

$ kill %2       # envoie SIGTERM au job 2
$ kill -9 %1    # envoie SIGKILL au job 1 (force)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_désown_kabuktan_ayrılmak&quot;&gt;désown : kabuktan ayrılmak&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;disown`Kabuğun işler tablosundan bir iş çıkarılır. İşlem çalışmaya devam eder ancak artık geri getirilemez ile`fg&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
[1] 12345

$ disown %1
# Le processus continue mais n&#39;est plus lié au shell
# Ça survives à la fermeture du terminal&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_uzun_süreçler_için_nohup_ile_birlikte_kullanın&quot;&gt;Uzun süreçler için nohup ile birlikte kullanın&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir sürecin terminalin kapatılmasından sonra hayatta kalması için:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ nohup ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
[1] 12345
$ disown %1
# Le build continue même si vous fermez le terminal&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/advanced-tips.svg&quot; alt=&quot;advanced tips&quot; width=&quot;1409&quot; height=&quot;196&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_yaygın_tuzaklar_ve_hatalar&quot;&gt;Yaygın tuzaklar ve hatalar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ctrlz_ve_ctrlcyi_karıştırma&quot;&gt;Ctrl+Z ve Ctrl+C&amp;#8217;yi karıştırma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu en sık yapılan hata.&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+C`İşlemi öldürür.`Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;(onu) askıya alır. Eğer basarsınız`Ctrl+C`Refleks olarak tüm durum kaybolur — açık dosyalar, LLM oturumları, devam eden derlemeler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/ctrlz-vs-ctrlc.svg&quot; alt=&quot;ctrlz vs ctrlc&quot; width=&quot;1226&quot; height=&quot;129&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇şler_kabukta_yerel&quot;&gt;İşler kabukta yerel&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;jobs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; et `bg`seulement süreçleri başlatan kabukta çalışırlar. Eğer yeni bir terminal açarsanız, işleri görmeyeceksiniz de l&#39;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Terminal 1
$ vim file.txt
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim file.txt

# Terminal 2 (nouveau)
$ jobs
# (rien — les jobs sont locaux au shell)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sistem genelindeki süreçleri görmek için kullanın,&lt;code&gt;ps&lt;/code&gt; ou &lt;code&gt;htop&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;ps aux | grep vim&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇şler_kabuk_kapanınca_hayatta_kalmaz&quot;&gt;İşler kabuk kapanınca hayatta kalmaz.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Terminale kapanırsanız, askıya alınmış veya arka planda çalışan tüm işler silinir. Bir süreç hayatta kalmasını sağlamak için kullanın`nohup` + &lt;code&gt;disown&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ nohup ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
[1] 12345
$ disown %1
# Fermer le terminal → le build continue&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_etkileşimli_süreçler_ve_fg&quot;&gt;Etkileşimli süreçler ve fg&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bazı etkileşimli programlar bir sonra iyi değildir.&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;. Nadir olsa da olur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sinyal kullanan bazı programlar (vim, htop, less) iyi yönetir`Ctrl+Z`)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Uzun ağ programları (ssh, opencode) genellikle doğru şekilde alırlar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(ncurses) ile terminali değiştiren programlar bazen terminali beklenmedik bir duruma bırakabilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bozuk bir terminalde bir sonra`fg`, yazın :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;reset&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_özet_diyagram&quot;&gt;Özet diyagram&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/fg-recap.svg&quot; alt=&quot;fg recap&quot; width=&quot;1262&quot; height=&quot;233&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_fg_neden_düşük_tahmin_ediliyor&quot;&gt;Fg neden düşük tahmin ediliyor?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çoğu modern geliştirici keşfeder.`fg`Geç, belki de asla. Birkaç neden:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IDE&amp;#8217;ler terminali gizler.&lt;/strong&gt;: VS Code bir terminal entegreli, ama çoklu sekmeler yaparlar`fg`Daha az gerekli görünüyor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grafik araçları CLI&amp;#8217;lerin yerini alıyor.&lt;/strong&gt;: dosya yöneticileri, sistem monitörleri, grafiksel Git istemcileri&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tmux ve screen&lt;/strong&gt;bu multipleksörler aynı sorunu farklı şekilde çözerler, ama`fg`daha basit ve her zaman mevcut&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ancak,`fg`dir :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**evanselel? Wait check spelling: In Turkish it&amp;#8217;s &quot;evrensel&quot;. So output:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;evrensel&lt;strong&gt;Her POSIX kabuğunda (bash, zsh, fish &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;) mevcuttur
2. &lt;/strong&gt;Bağıl olmadan&lt;strong&gt;tmux veya screen kurmaya gerek yok.
3. &lt;/strong&gt;Anlık fotoğraf&lt;strong&gt;: iki vuruşlar (&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z`sonra`fg&lt;/code&gt;) durdurmak ve devam ettirmek
4. &lt;/strong&gt;Bağlam Koruyucu**: süreç durumu bozulmamıştır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/why-fg-underrated.svg&quot; alt=&quot;why fg underrated&quot; width=&quot;829&quot; height=&quot;227&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_teknik_not_sinyaller&quot;&gt;Teknik not: sinyaller&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Merak edenler için, İşte ilişkili sinyaller:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 14.2857%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5714%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5714%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5715%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;sinyal&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;İsim&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Gönderen&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Etki&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGINT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+C&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kesinti — işlemi sonlandırır.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGQUIT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+\&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Çekirdek dökümüyle çık&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;18&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGTSTP&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Etkileşimli durdur — süreci askıya alır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;19&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGCONT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Devam eder — askıya alınmış bir süreci yeniden başlatır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;15&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGTERM&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Temiz sonlandırma&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;9&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGKILL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill -9 %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Zorunlu sonlandırma (intersepta alınamaz)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tüm akış:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/signal-flow.svg&quot; alt=&quot;signal flow&quot; width=&quot;497&quot; height=&quot;495&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`fg`Bu, gizli bir ipucu değil — bu Unix kabuğunun temel mekanizmasıdır ve 1970&amp;#8217;lerden beri kullanılmaktadır. Çoğu geliştiricinin bunu fark etmemesi, günümüzün bir belirtileridir: IDE&amp;#8217;ler ve multiplexörler bizleri temellerden uzaklaştırmıştır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ama bir SSH sunucusunda olduğunuzda, bir minimal terminalde, veya sadece kullanırken`opencode`ve LLM tam iş yapıyor —&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;, `jobs`Sizin en iyi arkadaşlarınız&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;_ Ctrl+Z askıya alır, fg devam ettirir. Bu terminalin duraklatma-oynatma işlevi. &lt;/em&gt;_&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_referanslar&quot;&gt;Referanslar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;man bash&lt;/code&gt;— JOB CONTROL bölümü&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;man signal&lt;/code&gt;— POSIX sinyalleri listesi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/manual/bash.html#Job-Control&quot;&gt;Bash Referans Kılavuzu — İş Kontrolü&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/signal.7.html&quot;&gt;man 7 sinyal — Linux sinyalleri&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tldp.org/LDP/abs/html/x312743.htm&quot;&gt;Gelişmiş Bash‑Scripting Kılavuzu — İş Kontrolü&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

