&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi : 8 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neden VS Code içinde kurmak`/opt`veya aracılığıyla`apt`Kendi ev dizininize bir şey koyup, IDE&amp;#8217;nizi yazmadan oyun alanı haline getirebildiğiniz zaman`sudo`İşte yerel bir kurulumun ardından menü ve Dosya Gezgini yazı tiplerini büyültmek için yapılan şiddetli mücadele hakkında hikâye&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;tik&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- toc disabled --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_parcours_genel_bakışı&quot;&gt;Parcours genel bakışı&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/vscode-local-overview.svg&quot; alt=&quot;vscode local overview&quot; width=&quot;1098&quot; height=&quot;380&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_neden_vs_code_evhome&quot;&gt;Neden: VS Code ev/Home&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_sistem_kurulumundaki_sorun&quot;&gt;Sistem kurulumundaki sorun&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code kurulu via`apt`, &lt;code&gt;dnf`veya içinde&lt;/code&gt;/opt`Doğal CSS&amp;#8217;deki tüm değişiklikler, de`product.json`veya kurulum klasörü gerektirir`sudo`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ancak, kullanırken&lt;strong&gt;opencode&lt;/strong&gt;(Kodunuz üzerindeki bir LLM&amp;#8217;yi pilotlamak için CLI aracı), ajanın yapabilmesi gereken:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yapılandırma dosyalarına yazmak`~/.config/Code/User/settings.json`) — ça, bu zaten evde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Değiştir IDE varlıklarını (workbench CSS,&lt;code&gt;product.json&lt;/code&gt;) gelişmiş özelleştirmeler için — bu, sudo olmadan engelleniyor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çözüm_yerel_bir_kurulum&quot;&gt;Çözüm: yerel bir kurulum&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resmi tarball arşivi indirilir ve doğrudan içinde açılır.&lt;code&gt;~/apps/&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;mkdir -p ~/apps
cd ~/apps
wget &quot;https://code.visualstudio.com/sha/download?build=stable&amp;amp;os=linux-x64&quot; -O vscode.tar.gz
tar -xzf vscode.tar.gz
rm vscode.tar.gz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İkili dosya şu anda`~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/bin/code`. Hiçbiri`sudo`Herhangi bir dosyayı okumak, düzenlemek veya değiştirmek için gerekli yok.&lt;code&gt;~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_somut_avantajlar&quot;&gt;Somut avantajlar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/vscode-local-vs-system.svg&quot; alt=&quot;vscode local vs system&quot; width=&quot;1652&quot; height=&quot;209&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 66.6667%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Avantaj&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Ayrıntı&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sudo yok&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;IDE&amp;#8217;deki tüm dosyalar kullanıcıya aittir.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Doğrudan CSS Düzenlemesi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yamalanabilir`workbench.desktop.main.css`yetki yükseltme olmadan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kendi yapımı güncelleme komut dosyası&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Basit bir kabuk betiği, otomatik olarak indirir, değiştirir ve tekrar yama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İzolasyon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sistem kurulumu temiz; rollback = klasörü sil&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_ana_menü_yazı_tipini_özelleştir&quot;&gt;Ana menü yazı tipini özelleştir&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tespit&quot;&gt;tespit&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Menü çubuğunun (Dosya, Düzenle, Görünüm…) ve açılır menülerinin varsayılan yazı tipi çok küçük; VS Code bunu değiştirmek için herhangi bir ayar sunmaz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_teknik_doğrudan_css_yaması&quot;&gt;Teknik: doğrudan CSS yaması&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dosyanın sonuna CSS eklenir.&lt;code&gt;workbench.desktop.main.css&lt;/code&gt;(empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/menubar-patch-sequence.svg&quot; alt=&quot;menubar patch sequence&quot; width=&quot;647&quot; height=&quot;599&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;CSS_FILE=&quot;$HOME/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/resources/app/out/vs/workbench/workbench.desktop.main.css&quot;

cat &amp;gt;&amp;gt; &quot;$CSS_FILE&quot; &amp;lt;&amp;lt; &#39;EOF&#39;
.menubar-menu-title{font-size:23px!important}
.menubar&amp;gt;.menubar-menu-button{font-size:23px!important}
.monaco-menu-option{font-size:22px!important;line-height:34px!important}
.monaco-menu .action-label:not(.codicon){font-size:22px!important}
.menubar-menu-items-holder .monaco-menu .action-item .action-label{font-size:22px!important}
EOF&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bütünlük_uyarısını_kaldır&quot;&gt;Bütünlük uyarısını kaldır&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code dosyalarındaki değişiklikleri algılar ve &quot;Your installation is corrupt&quot; uyarı çubuğunu gösterir. Bunun önüne geçmek için checksumları sileriz.&lt;code&gt;product.json&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-python hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;python&quot;&gt;import json
product_json = &quot;$HOME/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/resources/app/product.json&quot;
with open(product_json, &#39;r&#39;) as f:
    data = json.load(f)
data.pop(&#39;checksums&#39;, None)
with open(product_json, &#39;w&#39;) as f:
    json.dump(data, f, indent=2)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yeniden başlatıldıktan sonra artık uyarı kalmadı ve menüler artık okunabilir hâle geldi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_gezgini_bölmesi_yazı_tipini_özelleştir_mücadele&quot;&gt;Gezgini Bölmesi Yazı Tipini Özelleştir — Mücadele&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_deneme_1_var_olmayan_bir_parametre&quot;&gt;Deneme 1 : var olmayan bir parametre&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İlk önce yerel parametreyi deneriz`workbench.tree.fontSize`içinde`settings.json`I’m sorry, but I didn’t see any French text to translate. Could you please provide the content you’d like translated from French to Turkish?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-json hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;json&quot;&gt;{
    &quot;workbench.tree.fontSize&quot;: 20
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç :&lt;strong&gt;Etki yok&lt;/strong&gt;. Bu ayar VS Code&amp;#8217;da bulunmaz. Tanınmayan ayarların sessizce yoksayıldığı kanıtı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_2_deneme_custom_css_and_js_loader_uzantısı&quot;&gt;2. Deneme: Custom CSS and JS Loader uzantısı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Uzantıyı kuruyoruz`be5invis.vscode-custom-css`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/bin/code --install-extension be5invis.vscode-custom-css&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir CSS dosyası içinde oluşturuyoruz.`~/.vscode-custom-css/custom.css`Dosya Gezgini&amp;#8217;nin öğelerini hedefleyen seçicilerle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-css hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;css&quot;&gt;.monaco-tree-rows .monaco-tree-row,
.sidebar .monaco-list-row,
.explorer-viewlet .monaco-list-row,
.monaco-list-row .monaco-icon-label {
    font-size: 22px !important;
    line-height: 36px !important;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ve bu dosyayı ayarlar içinde gösteririz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-json hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;json&quot;&gt;{
    &quot;vscode_custom_css.imports&quot;: [
        &quot;file:///home/user/.vscode-custom-css/custom.css&quot;
    ]
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç :&lt;strong&gt;Değişiklikler geçerli değil&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tuzağı_her_zamanki_gibi_uzantıyı_etkinleştirmek_zorundayız_no_thats_not_correct&quot;&gt;Tuzağı: her zamanki gibi uzantıyı etkinleştirmek zorundayız. (No, that&amp;#8217;s not correct.)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;#8217;s produce concise translation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;Tuzağı: her seferinde eklentiyi etkinleştirmek gerekir.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But we might choose exact phrase: &quot;Tuzak: her zaman uzantıyı etkinleştirmek zorundayız.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pick one: &quot;Tuzağı: her zaman uzantıyı etkinleştirmek gerekir.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Will go with that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;/think&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tuzağı: her zaman uzantıyı etkinleştirmek gerekir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti dokümantasyonu bu kritik noktada net değildir: Her özel CSS değişikliğinde yapmanız gerekiyor&lt;strong&gt;kesinlikle&lt;/strong&gt;Paletten komutunu çalıştır :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Shift+P&lt;/code&gt;→ yaz&lt;strong&gt;Özel CSS ve JS&amp;#8217;yi Etkinleştir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code yeniden başlatma istiyor → kabul et&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu adım olmadan, CSS hiçbir zaman IDE&amp;#8217;ye enjekte edilmez.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_deneme_3_çizgiler_üst_üste_geliyor&quot;&gt;Deneme 3 : çizgiler üst üste geliyor.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ile birlikte bile`font-size: 22px` et &lt;code&gt;line-height: 36px&lt;/code&gt;, jambali harfler (g, p, f, b) komşu satırlara taşarlar. Eklemeye çalışılıyor`height` et &lt;code&gt;min-height&lt;/code&gt;(Empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-css hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;css&quot;&gt;.monaco-list-row {
    height: 36px !important;
    min-height: 36px !important;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç :&lt;strong&gt;hiçbir değişiklik&lt;/strong&gt;. VS Code satır yüksekliğini JavaScript kullanarak hesaplar ve CSS değerlerini geçersiz kılar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çözüm_zoom_ana_kapsayıcı&quot;&gt;Çözüm: &lt;code&gt;zoom&lt;/code&gt; ana kapsayıcı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/explorer-css-approaches.svg&quot; alt=&quot;explorer css approaches&quot; width=&quot;465&quot; height=&quot;807&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JavaScript düzeniyle mücadele etmek yerine, özelliği kullanırız.`zoom`satır konteyneri üzerinde :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-css hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;css&quot;&gt;.explorer-viewlet .monaco-list-rows,
.sidebar .monaco-list-rows {
    zoom: 1.25;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`zoom`Konteynerin renderini metin ve boşluk birlikte uniform olarak büyütür; VS Code&amp;#8217;un JavaScript motorunun hesapladığı layout&amp;#8217;u bozmadan. 1.25 faktörü yaklaşık olarak 13px&amp;#8217;ten 16px&amp;#8217;e geçişe denk geliyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç :&lt;strong&gt;dosya isimleri artık okunabilir, satırlar doğru şekilde aralıklı&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_seçicilerin_özeti_ve_çalışan_şeyler&quot;&gt;Seçicilerin özeti ve çalışan şeyler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Yaklaşım&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;CSS&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;font-size`üzerine&lt;/code&gt;.monaco-list-row`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;font-size: 22px !important&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Metin daha büyük ancak satırlar üst üste&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;line-height&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;height`üstte&lt;/code&gt;.monaco-list-row`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;line-height: 36px; height: 36px&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Etki yok (JS geçersiz)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;zoom`üzerine&lt;/code&gt;.monaco-list-rows`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;zoom: 1.25&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Başarılı — metin + boşluk orantısal&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_otomatik_güncelleme_skripti&quot;&gt;Otomatik güncelleme skripti&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/vscode-update-sequence.svg&quot; alt=&quot;vscode update sequence&quot; width=&quot;1229&quot; height=&quot;639&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_sorun&quot;&gt;Sorun&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code güncellendiğinde, kurulum klasörünü değiştirir ve&lt;strong&gt;Tüm CSS yamalarını siler&lt;/strong&gt;. Değişiklikleri her zaman manuel olarak yeniden uygulamamız gerekiyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_komut_dosyası_vscode_update_sh&quot;&gt;Komut dosyası `vscode-update.sh&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oluşturuyoruz`~/apps/vscode-update.sh`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;#!/bin/bash
set -e

VSCODE_DIR=&quot;$HOME/apps/VSCode-linux-x64&quot;
BACKUP_DIR=&quot;$HOME/apps/vscode-backup&quot;
TEMP_DIR=&quot;/tmp/vscode-update&quot;

MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE=&quot;23px&quot;
DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE=&quot;22px&quot;

echo &quot;=== VS Code Local Updater ===&quot;

CURRENT_VERSION=$(&quot;$VSCODE_DIR/bin/code&quot; --version 2&amp;gt;/dev/null | head -1)
echo &quot;Current version: $CURRENT_VERSION&quot;

echo &quot;Downloading latest VS Code...&quot;
mkdir -p &quot;$TEMP_DIR&quot;
wget -q &quot;https://code.visualstudio.com/sha/download?build=stable&amp;amp;os=linux-x64&quot; \
    -O &quot;$TEMP_DIR/vscode.tar.gz&quot;

echo &quot;Extracting...&quot;
mkdir -p &quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted&quot;
tar -xzf &quot;$TEMP_DIR/vscode.tar.gz&quot; -C &quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted&quot;

NEW_VERSION=$(&quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted/VSCode-linux-x64/bin/code&quot; \
    --version 2&amp;gt;/dev/null | head -1)
echo &quot;New version: $NEW_VERSION&quot;

if [ &quot;$CURRENT_VERSION&quot; = &quot;$NEW_VERSION&quot; ]; then
    echo &quot;Already up to date!&quot;
    rm -rf &quot;$TEMP_DIR&quot;
    exit 0
fi

echo &quot;Backing up current installation...&quot;
mkdir -p &quot;$BACKUP_DIR&quot;
cp -r &quot;$VSCODE_DIR&quot; &quot;$BACKUP_DIR/VSCode-linux-x64-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)&quot;

echo &quot;Updating...&quot;
rm -rf &quot;$VSCODE_DIR&quot;
mv &quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted/VSCode-linux-x64&quot; &quot;$VSCODE_DIR&quot;
rm -rf &quot;$TEMP_DIR&quot;

CSS_FILE=&quot;$VSCODE_DIR/resources/app/out/vs/workbench/workbench.desktop.main.css&quot;
echo &quot;Re-applying custom CSS patch \
    (menubar=${MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE}, dropdown=${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE})...&quot;
cat &amp;gt;&amp;gt; &quot;$CSS_FILE&quot; &amp;lt;&amp;lt; CSSEOF
.menubar-menu-title{font-size:${MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE}!important}\
.menubar&amp;gt;.menubar-menu-button{font-size:${MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE}!important}\
.monaco-menu-option{font-size:${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE}!important;\
line-height:34px!important}\
.monaco-menu .action-label:not(.codicon)\
{font-size:${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE}!important}\
.menubar-menu-items-holder .monaco-menu .action-item .action-label\
{font-size:${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE}!important}
CSSEOF

PRODUCT_JSON=&quot;$VSCODE_DIR/resources/app/product.json&quot;
if [ -f &quot;$PRODUCT_JSON&quot; ]; then
    echo &quot;Removing checksums to prevent integrity warning...&quot;
    python3 -c &quot;
import json
with open(&#39;$PRODUCT_JSON&#39;,&#39;r&#39;) as f: data=json.load(f)
data.pop(&#39;checksums&#39;, None)
with open(&#39;$PRODUCT_JSON&#39;,&#39;w&#39;) as f: json.dump(data,f,indent=2)
print(&#39;Done.&#39;)
&quot;
fi

echo &quot;=== Update complete: $CURRENT_VERSION -&amp;gt; $NEW_VERSION ===&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Betik:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En son stabil sürümü indir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mevcut sürümle farklı olup olmadığını kontrol et&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yedekle geçerli kurulumu (zaman damgalı) içinde`~/apps/vscode-backup/`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kurulum klasörünü değiştir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tekrar uygular&lt;/strong&gt;ana menünün CSS yaması&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Checksumları sil&lt;/strong&gt; de `product.json`entegrite uyarısından kaçınmak için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gezin bölmesindeki özelleştirme(ler), özel CSS eklentisi ve dosya aracılığıyla`~/.vscode-custom-css/custom.css`Güncellemeleri hayatta kalırlar çünkü kurulum klasörünün dışında yaşıyorlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇lgili_dosyalar_genel_bakış&quot;&gt;İlgili Dosyalar — Genel Bakış&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/vscode-files-deployment.svg&quot; alt=&quot;vscode files deployment&quot; width=&quot;910&quot; height=&quot;331&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5714%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 42.8571%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5715%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Yol&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Rol&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Güncellemelerle hayatta kalır mı?&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;IDE kurulumu&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır (değiştirildi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/resources/app/out/vs/workbench/workbench.desktop.main.css&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;workbench CSS (menu, dropdowns)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Non (script tarafından yeniden yamalandı)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/resources/app/product.json&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Bütünlük kontrol toplamları&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır (script tarafından yeniden temizlendi)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;~/apps/vscode-update.sh&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Otomatik güncelleme betiği&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Evet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;~/.config/Code/User/settings.json&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kullanıcı ayarları (fontSize, özel CSS)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Evet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;~/.vscode-custom-css/custom.css&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Özel CSS Explorer (yakınlaştırma) için&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Evet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_öğrenilen_dersler&quot;&gt;Öğrenilen dersler&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/vscode-lessons-learned.svg&quot; alt=&quot;vscode lessons learned&quot; width=&quot;1153&quot; height=&quot;517&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ev_klasörüne_kurulum_yapmak_her_şeyi_serbest_bırakır&quot;&gt;Ev klasörüne kurulum yapmak her şeyi serbest bırakır&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir yerel kurulum içinde`~/apps`sağlar bir tam kontrol üzerinde VS Code :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;yok`sudo`CSS veya yapılandırmayı düzenlemek için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Opencode+LLM agenti, IDE&amp;#8217;nin yapılandırma dosyalarına ve varlıklarına yazabilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rollback trivi : zaman damgalı yedeği geri yükle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_zoom_font_size_bileşenler_listesi_için&quot;&gt;zoom` &amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;font-size&lt;/code&gt; bileşenler listesi için&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code, JavaScript kullanarak satır yüksekliğini kontrol eder. Düzenle`font-size`Düzenleme motoru tarafından ayrılan yüksekliğe müdahale edilememesi, taşan metinlere sebep olur. Özellik`zoom`Ana kapsayıcıyı büyütmek, tüm içeriği orantılı olarak genişletir ve bu sorunu aşar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_custom_css_uzantısı_açıkça_etkinleştirilmesi_gerekiyor&quot;&gt;Custom CSS uzantısı açıkça etkinleştirilmesi gerekiyor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu bir &quot;set and forget&quot; parametresi değil. Her CSS custom dosyasındaki değişiklik &quot;Enable Custom CSS and JS&quot;yi komut paletinden yeniden çalıştırmayı gerektirir (&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Shift+P&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bir_güncelleme_komut_dosyası_zorunludur&quot;&gt;Bir güncelleme komut dosyası zorunludur&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Script olmadan, her VS Code güncellemesi workbench&amp;#8217;ten CSS yamalarını siler. Script`vscode-update.sh`İndirme, değiştirme, yeniden yama ve checksum temizlemeyi otomatikleştirir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_hızlı_referanslar&quot;&gt;Hızlı referanslar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code indirme : &lt;a href=&quot;https://code.visualstudio.com/Download&quot; class=&quot;bare&quot;&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/Download&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Özel CSS ve JS Yükleyici Eklentisi:`be5invis.vscode-custom-css`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code&amp;#8217;un keşif gezgini yazı tipi için yerel bir parametre istemesini içeren sorun :https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/149[github.com/microsoft/vscode#149]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

