&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sonraki_adım&quot;&gt;Sonraki adım&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bağlam_ve_hedef&quot;&gt;Bağlam ve Hedef&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_başlangıç_noktası&quot;&gt;Başlangıç noktası&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proje`slider-gradle`AsciiDoc dosyalarından Gradle eklentisi üzerinden Reveal.js sunumları oluşturur.&lt;code&gt;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&lt;/code&gt;. Ana görev yapılandırması`asciidoctorRevealJs`Kök buildscript&amp;#8217;te doğrudan yaşıyordu`build.gradle.kts`(Note: The assistant outputs nothing because no text was provided for translation.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;plugins { id(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&quot;) }

apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()

project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
    repositories { ruby { gems() } }
    revealjs {
        version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
        templateGitHub {
            setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
            setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
            setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
        }
    }
    revealjsOptions {
        // ... configuration complète
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_hedef&quot;&gt;Hedef&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bütün bu yapılandırmayı içine taşı`buildSrc/src/main/kotlin/slides/SlidesPlugin.kt`Tüketici buildscriptini sadece şu hale getirmek için :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti tamamen otonom olmalıdır : kendi eklenti bağımlılıklarını uygular, depolarını yapılandırır ve Ruby gem&amp;#8217;lerini yönetir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇lk_engel_ruby_gems&quot;&gt;İlk engel: `ruby { gems() }&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_groovy_sözdizimi_şekeri_ne_saklar&quot;&gt;Groovy sözdizimi şekeri ne saklar.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Satır`repositories { ruby { gems() } }`Bu, yalnızca buildscript yürütme bağlamında mevcut olan bir Groovy DSL uzantısıdır. Bu, buildSrc&amp;#8217;ten erişilebilen statik bir Kotlin API olarak mevcut değildir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Onu aramaya çalışırken`SlidesPlugin.kt`, derleme hemen başarısız olur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_mekanizmanın_ayrıştırılması&quot;&gt;Mekanizmanın ayrıştırılması&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gradle önbelleği analiz ettikten sonra (&lt;code&gt;~/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/rubygems/&lt;/code&gt;), dosyada keşfederiz`ivy-3.1.0.xml` :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-xml hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;xml&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;artifact type=&#39;gem&#39; url=&#39;https://rubygems.org/gems/asciidoctor-revealjs-3.1.0.gem&#39; /&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`ruby { gems() }`Aslında yapıyordu&lt;strong&gt;üç ayrı işlem&lt;/strong&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İsaret eden bir Ivy deposu kaydet`https://rubygems.org/gems/`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grubu hariç tut`rubygems`Maven deposları çakışmaları önlemek için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gem&amp;#8217;i yapılandırmaya kaydedin`asciidoctorGems`JRuby&amp;#8217;nun çalışma zamanında yüklemesi için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu üç sorumluluk, Kotlin&amp;#8217;de ayrı ayrı yeniden oluşturulmalıdır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_üç_bölümlü_çözüm&quot;&gt;Üç bölümlü çözüm&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bölüm_1_rubygems_için_ivy_deposu&quot;&gt;Bölüm 1: RubyGems için Ivy deposu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.repositories.mavenCentral() {
    content { excludeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
}
project.repositories.ivy {
    url = project.uri(&quot;https://rubygems.org/gems/&quot;)
    patternLayout { artifact(&quot;[module]-[revision].gem&quot;) } &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;
    metadataSources { artifact() }
    content { includeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Uzantı`.gem`Hardcode edilmelidir.&lt;code&gt;[ext]`Varsayılan olarak çözer&lt;/code&gt;.jar`, bu bir hataya yol açar`Resource missing`.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ivy deposu doğrudan üzerinde beyan edilmiştir`project.repositories`ve değil içinde bir blok`repositories { }`Bu bloğun alıcısı değil`RepositoryHandler`gradle standartı ancak bir grolifant api uzantıyla uyumsuz`ivy`Kotlin DSL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_parça_2_asciidoctorgems_bağımlılığı&quot;&gt;Parça 2 : asciidoctorGems bağımlılığı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti`org.asciidoctor.jvm.gems`İlk olarak uygulanmalıdır — yapılandırmayı oluşturur.&lt;code&gt;asciidoctorGems`ve görevi`asciidoctorGemsPrepare&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.plugins.apply(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.gems&quot;)
project.plugins.apply(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&quot;) &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;

project.dependencies {
    add(&quot;asciidoctorGems&quot;, &quot;rubygems:asciidoctor-revealjs:3.1.0@gem&quot;) &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(2)&lt;/b&gt;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Uygulama sırası önemlidir :`gems`önce`revealjs`. Nitelikleyici`@gem`Doğru uzantıyı bağımlılığa zorla uygula&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bölüm_3_settings_gradle_kts&quot;&gt;Bölüm 3 : settings.gradle.kts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`dependencyResolutionManagement`içinde`settings.gradle.kts`Proje&amp;#8217;lerin kendi depolarını bildirmesine izin verilmeli:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Suppress(&quot;UnstableApiUsage&quot;)
dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.PREFER_PROJECT)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu satır olmadan, Gradle eklentide bildirilen depoları yoksayar ve gem çözümlemesi başarısız olur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bytekodla_api_introspeksiyonu&quot;&gt;Bytekodla API introspeksiyonu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_neden_javap&quot;&gt;Neden &lt;code&gt;javap&lt;/code&gt; ?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti`asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides`sürümde`4.0.0-alpha.1`. Dokümantasyonu yok ya da eksiktir. Tek güvenilir kaynak, derlenmiş sınıfların doğrudan incelenmesidir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_görev_hiyerarşisi&quot;&gt;Görev hiyerarşisi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask
  extends org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask
  implements org.asciidoctor.gradle.base.slides.SlidesToExportAware&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_keşif_forkoptions&quot;&gt;Keşif `forkOptions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İnceleyerek`AbstractAsciidoctorTask`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask | grep -i &quot;fork\|exec\|jvm&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bulunur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;final org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions javaForkOptions;
public void forkOptions(org.gradle.api.Action&amp;lt;org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions&amp;gt;);
public static final org.asciidoctor.gradle.base.process.ProcessMode JAVA_EXEC;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_javaforkoptions_apisi_grolifant&quot;&gt;JavaForkOptions API&amp;#8217;si (grolifant)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`javaLauncher`Bu görevde mevcut değil. Gerçek API&amp;#8217;nin`org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions`göster :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public void executable(java.lang.Object);  &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;
public void setExecutable(java.lang.Object);&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yöntem`executable(Object)`atamayı değiştirir`executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;`derlemeyen (`val`yeniden atanamaz).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_revealjs_uzantısı&quot;&gt;RevealJS Uzantısı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`revealjs { }`bir görev yöntemi değil ama bir&lt;strong&gt;Proje uzantısı&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.RevealJSExtension&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu şekilde erişilir :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;().apply {
    version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
    templateGitHub {
        setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
        setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
        setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_java_araç_zinciri_yapılandırması&quot;&gt;Java araç zinciri yapılandırması&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_javatoolchainservicenin_sorunu&quot;&gt;JavaToolchainService&amp;#8217;nin sorunu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`JavaToolchainService`bir proje uzantısı değil. Aşağıdaki çağrı başarısız olur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ERREUR : Extension of type &#39;JavaToolchainService&#39; does not exist
project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doğru API&amp;#8217;dir`serviceOf`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;import org.gradle.kotlin.dsl.support.serviceOf

project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
    setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)
    forkOptions {
        executable(
            project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()
                .launcherFor {
                    languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(17))
                    vendor.set(JvmVendorSpec.ADOPTIUM)
                }
                .get()
                .executablePath
                .asFile
                .absolutePath
        )
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_docker_otomatik_algılama&quot;&gt;Docker otomatik algılama&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bağlam&quot;&gt;Bağlam&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Asciidoctor/JRuby eklentisi Java 17 gerektiriyor. buildSrc&amp;#8217;teki Kotlin 2.0.x, Java 25&amp;#8217;i desteklemiyor (sürüm parserı çöker`&quot;25.0.2&quot;`). Gradle daemonının Java 17&amp;#8217;de çalıştırılması gerekir ya da Docker kullanılmalıdır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_strategi&quot;&gt;strategi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker kullanılabilir → konteyner üzerinden çalıştırma`eclipse-temurin:17`(varsayılan davranış)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker eksik + Java 17 → yerel yürütme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker eksik + Java &amp;gt; 17 → açık hata&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val isDockerAvailable = try {
    Runtime.getRuntime().exec(arrayOf(&quot;docker&quot;, &quot;info&quot;)).waitFor() == 0
} catch (e: Exception) {
    false
}

val javaVersion = JavaVersion.current().majorVersion.toInt()

when {
    isDockerAvailable -&amp;gt; project.tasks.register&amp;lt;Exec&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
        group = GROUP_TASK_SLIDER
        description = &quot;Slider settings and generation (via Docker)&quot;
        dependsOn(TASK_CLEAN_SLIDES_BUILD)
        finalizedBy(TASK_DASHBOARD_SLIDES_BUILD)
        commandLine(
            &quot;docker&quot;, &quot;run&quot;, &quot;--rm&quot;,
            &quot;-v&quot;, &quot;${project.rootDir.absolutePath}:/workspace&quot;,
            &quot;-v&quot;, &quot;${System.getProperty(&quot;user.home&quot;)}/.gradle:/root/.gradle&quot;,
            &quot;-w&quot;, &quot;/workspace&quot;,
            &quot;eclipse-temurin:17&quot;,
            &quot;./gradlew&quot;, TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS
        )
        workingDir = project.rootDir
    }
    javaVersion == 17 -&amp;gt; {
        project.repositories.mavenCentral() {
            content { excludeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
        }
        project.repositories.ivy {
            url = project.uri(&quot;https://rubygems.org/gems/&quot;)
            patternLayout { artifact(&quot;[module]-[revision].gem&quot;) }
            metadataSources { artifact() }
            content { includeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
        }
        project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;().apply {
            version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
            templateGitHub {
                setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
                setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
                setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
            }
        }
        project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
            setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)
            forkOptions {
                executable(
                    project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()
                        .launcherFor {
                            languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(17))
                            vendor.set(JvmVendorSpec.ADOPTIUM)
                        }
                        .get()
                        .executablePath
                        .asFile
                        .absolutePath
                )
            }
            // ... reste de la configuration
        }
    }
    else -&amp;gt; error(
        &quot;Docker est requis pour exécuter $TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS &quot; +
        &quot;avec Java $javaVersion. Installez Docker ou utilisez Java 17.&quot;
    )
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tüketici_buildscripti&quot;&gt;Tüketici buildscripti&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu kadar. Eklenti tüm sorumluluğunu taşıyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_settings_gradle_kts&quot;&gt;settings.gradle.kts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;pluginManagement {
    repositories {
        mavenLocal()
        gradlePluginPortal()
    }
}

plugins {
    id(&quot;org.gradle.toolchains.foojay-resolver-convention&quot;) version &quot;0.8.0&quot;
}

@Suppress(&quot;UnstableApiUsage&quot;)
dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.PREFER_PROJECT)
}

rootProject.name = &quot;slider-gradle&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_tuzaklar_ve_çözümler_özeti&quot;&gt;Tuzaklar ve Çözümler Özeti&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 37.5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 37.5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Sorun&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Neden&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Çözüm&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`ruby { gems() }`Kotlin&amp;#8217;te kullanılamaz&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sadece Groovy DSL uzantısı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Üç ayrı mekanizma : repo Ivy + Maven hariç tutma +&lt;code&gt;asciidoctorGems&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Gradle bir`.jar`Birinin yerine`.gem`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`[ext]`çözer en`jar`varsayılan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sabit kodlayan`.gem`Ivy + kategorie pattern içinde`@gem`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;ivy { }`içinde derlenmez`repositories { }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Receiver grolifant Kotlin DSL ile uyumsuz&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Doğrudan çağrı`project.repositories.ivy { }`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`javaLauncher`çözülmemiş&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;mevcut olmayan özellik üzerine`AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;forkOptions { executable(&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;) }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;`Derlenmiyor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Mülk`val`içinde`JavaForkOptions`grolifant&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yöntem`executable(Object)`yerine&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;JavaToolchainService`bulunamaz via`extensions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Bir Gradle hizmetidir, bir eklenti değil&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`revealjs { }`görevde çözülmemiş&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Proje uzantısı, görev metodu değil&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Derleme Java 25 ile çöker.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kotlin 2.0.x iki haneli Java sürümlerini ayrıştırmaz.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Otomatik Docker tespiti + Java 17 geri dönüşü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_araştırma_yöntemi_javap_ile_bilinmeyen_bir_api_okumak&quot;&gt;Araştırma yöntemi: javap ile bilinmeyen bir API okumak&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_prensip&quot;&gt;Prensip&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dokümantasyon eksik veya tamamlanmamışsa, bytecode&amp;#8217;lar doğruluk kaynağıdır. &lt;code&gt;javap`JDK&amp;#8217;nin standart aracıdır ve dosyaları dersini çözer&lt;/code&gt;.class`okunabilir Java imzalarıyla kaynak kodu gerektirmeden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_1_gradle_önbellekte_jarı_bul&quot;&gt;Adım 1: Gradle önbellekte jar&amp;#8217;ı bul&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gradle tüm bağımlılıklarını indirir`~/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/`. İlk adım, incelenecek sınıfı içeren jar&amp;#8217;ı bulmaktır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sonuç :&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;/home/user/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/org.asciidoctor/
asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides/4.0.0-alpha.1/.../
asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_2_jar_dosyasındaki_sınıfları_listele&quot;&gt;Adım 2: JAR dosyasındaki sınıfları listele&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir sınıfı incelemeden önce, JAR içinde mevcut olduğundan emin oluruz :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;jar tf asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar | grep -i &quot;RevealJS\|revealjs&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_3_bir_sınıfı_incelemek&quot;&gt;Adım 3 : bir sınıfı incelemek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Bu tüm kullanılabilir sınıfları gösterir: &lt;code&gt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RevealJSExtension&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RevealJSOptions&lt;/code&gt;, etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seçenek`-p`Gizli olanlar da dahil tüm üyeleri gösterir. Sonuç, anahtar satırını hemen gösterir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask
extends org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_4_hiyerarşiyi_tırmanın&quot;&gt;Adım 4 : Hiyerarşiyi tırmanın&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Görev genişletir`AbstractAsciidoctorTask`. Bir kez daha incelenir. ilk önce jar&amp;#8217;ını bularak :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-[0-9]*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null

javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask | grep -i &quot;fork\|exec\|jvm\|java&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orada keşfederiz`forkOptions`, &lt;code&gt;JAVA_EXEC&lt;/code&gt;, et &lt;code&gt;javaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt; tipindeki`org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_5_bilinmeyen_türleri_takip_etmek&quot;&gt;Adım 5 : Bilinmeyen türleri takip etmek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`JavaForkOptions`bir bilinmeyen grolifant sınıfıdır. Jar&amp;#8217;ını buluyoruz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;grolifant*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonra onu inceleriz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath grolifant40-legacy-api-2.0.0-alpha.6.jar \
org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burada bulunur`executable(java.lang.Object)&lt;code&gt;— doğru yöntemi çağırmak, karşısında`executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;`Derlenmeyen, çünkü bir özelliğidir`val&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_6_proje_uzantılarını_kontrol_et&quot;&gt;Adım 6 : proje uzantılarını kontrol et&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İçin`revealjs { }`, soru şöyleydi: bu bir görevin yöntemi mi? Veya bir proje uzantısı? Denetimi`AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask` Herhangi bir yöntem göstermez`revealjs`. Sonra kontrol ederiz`RevealJSExtension`(Empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.RevealJSExtension | head -5&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class RevealJSExtension implements groovy.lang.GroovyObject {
public static final java.lang.String NAME;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;varlığı`NAME`Bu projeye kayıtlı bir uzantı olduğunu doğruluyor erişilebilir`project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;()`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_yöntemin_özeti&quot;&gt;Yöntemin özeti&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 75%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Adım&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Eylem&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;*.jar&quot;&lt;/code&gt;— Jar&amp;#8217;ı konumlandırmak&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;jar tf jar.jar | grep NomClasse&lt;/code&gt;— sınıfın var olduğunu kontrol edin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;javap -p -classpath jar.jar NomCompletClasse&lt;/code&gt;— sınıfı denetlemek&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Tanımlayıcı`extends`ve hiyerarşiyi tırmanmak&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Bilinmeyen tipleri kendi JAR&amp;#8217;larında takip edin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Aramak`NAME`Proje uzantısını tanımlamak için&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu yöntem, dokümantasyonu olmayan herhangi bir Gradle eklentisine uygulanır. ve alfa sürümü artık mevcut dokümantasyona uygun değil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonraki_adım&quot;&gt;Sonraki adım&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu buildSrc eklentisi Gradle Plugin Portal veya Maven Local&amp;#8217;de yayınlanan bağımsız bir proje içinde çıkarılacak. Tüketici buildscripti şöyle olur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;plugins { id(&quot;slides&quot;) version &quot;1.0.0&quot; }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Et &lt;code&gt;settings.gradle.kts`sadece minimum seviyeye indirilecek atıfta bulunmadan`foojay-resolver-convention&lt;/code&gt;, JDK provisioning eklenti tarafından kendisiyle yönetiliyor ya da ön koşul olarak belgeleniyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

