&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_mimari_vizyon&quot;&gt;Mimari Vizyon&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_yönlendirici_ilke&quot;&gt;Yönlendirici ilke&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mimari, &lt;strong&gt;İlgililiklerin Ayrılması&lt;/strong&gt; ilkesine dayanır :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;İçerik&lt;/strong&gt;: zengin metaveri içeren yapılandırılmış AsciiDoc dosyaları&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sunum&lt;/strong&gt; : Yeniden kullanılabilir Thymeleaf şablonları&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veri&lt;/strong&gt; : JBake tarafından AsciiDoc özelliklerinden otomatik olarak çıkarılan model&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stil&lt;/strong&gt; : Görsel tutarlılık için Bootstrap 5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_stratejik_seçenek_portföy_için_asciidoc&quot;&gt;Stratejik seçenek: Portföy için AsciiDoc&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;caption class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Table 1. Neden AsciiDoc ?&lt;/caption&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 66.6667%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;kriter&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Avantaj&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;tutarlılık&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Blog gönderileriyle aynı format.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Meta Veri&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yapılandırılmış ve genişletilebilir öznitelikler (&lt;code&gt;project-*&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Bakım yapılabilirlik&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Basit metin düzenleme, Git ile sürüm takibi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Esneklik&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Tablolar, kod ve görselleri içerebilir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Şablonlama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;JBake, Thymeleaf için öznitelikleri otomatik olarak çıkarır&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_veri_modeli&quot;&gt;Veri modeli&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her portföy projesi bir AsciiDoc belgesi ile :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Üst bilgi meta verileri&lt;/strong&gt; : yapılandırılmış bilgiler (müşteri, süre, teknolojiler, vb.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corps du document&lt;/strong&gt; : hikâye tarzında açıklama, zorluklar, çözümler, sonuçlar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Özel nitelikler&lt;/strong&gt; : önekli`project-*`otomatik ekstraksiyon için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-0a4b9dba3fcd25f2d3ffe710a16afc43.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;386&quot; height=&quot;811&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_detaylı_kullanım_senaryoları&quot;&gt;Detaylı Kullanım Senaryoları&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_uc1_portfolioya_bir_öğe_ekle&quot;&gt;UC1 : Portfolioya bir öğe ekle&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_nominal_akış&quot;&gt;Nominal akış&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-136f1fd9dec24f02b92f78ba1501813e.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;1025&quot; height=&quot;700&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_oluşturulacak_dosya_şablonu&quot;&gt;Oluşturulacak dosya şablonu&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Geliştirici oluşturur`content/portfolio/nom-projet.adoc`standart bir yapıyla :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tüm gerekli niteliklerle başlık&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standartlaştırılmış bölümler (Bağlam, Zorluklar, Çözümler, Sonuçlar)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tutarlı görüntü adlandırımı&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_validasyon_puanları&quot;&gt;Validasyon puanları&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zorunlu öznitelikler mevcuttur (&lt;code&gt;jbake-type&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;jbake-status&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;project-thumbnail&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Referans gösterilen görüntüler içinde mevcuttur.&lt;code&gt;assets/img/portfolio/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JBake derlemesi hatasız olarak başarılır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proje portföyo sayfasında gösterilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proje ayrıntılı sayfası düzgün görüntüleniyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_uc2_portföyden_bir_öğe_silin&quot;&gt;UC2 : Portföyden bir öğe silin&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_nominal_akış_2&quot;&gt;Nominal akış&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-3139496b9a9094d0fbd3ba3bf66fd92c.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;724&quot; height=&quot;645&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_alternatif_strateji_arşivleme&quot;&gt;Alternatif strateji: arşivleme&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Temiz silmek yerine bir klasör oluşturmak mümkün.&lt;code&gt;content/portfolio/archive/&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dosyayı silmek yerine taşı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kolayca geri yüklemesini sağlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Git geçmişini daha açık tut&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_kaynak_temizliği&quot;&gt;Kaynak temizliği&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Öksüz görüntüler kontrol et`assets/img/portfolio/`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Başka projeler tarafından referans gösterilmemiş görüntüleri sil&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JBake önbelleğini temizleyerek hayalet referanslardan kaçının.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_uc3_taslak_haline_getir&quot;&gt;UC3 : Taslak haline getir&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_nominal_akış_3&quot;&gt;Nominal akış&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-e600253ab403af9ff94f5a38defc631c.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;765&quot; height=&quot;654&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_olası_durumlar&quot;&gt;Olası durumlar&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-cf64e77074ba0598917768044dba4821.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;610&quot; height=&quot;448&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_tipik_kullanım_durumları&quot;&gt;Tipik kullanım durumları&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yazım aşamasında olan proje&lt;/strong&gt;: taslak olarak oluştur, hazır olduğunda yayınla&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geçici olarak gizli proje&lt;/strong&gt; : müşteri anlaşması olana kadar taslak duruma geçmek&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Büyük Güncelleme&lt;/strong&gt; : drafta geçmek, düzenlemek, tekrar yayınlamak&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A/B testing&lt;/strong&gt; : drafte kopyala, test et, en iyi versiyonu yayınla&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_şablonlama_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Şablonlama Mimarisi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tekrar_kullanılabilir_şablonlar_stratejisi&quot;&gt;Tekrar kullanılabilir şablonlar stratejisi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-7dd24d82e4da3da4baabc48014209b55.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;911&quot; height=&quot;335&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_veri_çıkarma_deseni&quot;&gt;Veri çıkarma deseni&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JBake, AsciiDoc özelliklerini otomatik olarak Thymeleaf içinde erişilebilir olan özelliklere dönüştürür :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-3882bd2d76ac0f6ec6f3e5da4e86674c.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;891&quot; height=&quot;346&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇simlendirme_kuralları&quot;&gt;İsimlendirme kuralları&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proje Özellikleri&lt;/strong&gt; : önek`project-*` (ex: &lt;code&gt;project-client&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;project-tech-stack&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dosyalar&lt;/strong&gt; : kebab-case (örnek:`ecommerce-platform.adoc`)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Görüntüler&lt;/strong&gt; : önek isim-proje (örn:`ecommerce-platform-thumb.jpg`)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Templates&lt;/strong&gt; : işlevsel ad (örnek:`project-card.html`, &lt;code&gt;tech-badge.html&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_yayın_i̇ş_akışı&quot;&gt;Yayın İş Akışı&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_geliştirme_hattı&quot;&gt;Geliştirme hattı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-cb5b7914c0560fc40c3cc286961a442b.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;386&quot; height=&quot;811&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ortamlar&quot;&gt;ortamlar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 20%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 40%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 40%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Ortam&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kullanım&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kabul edilen statü&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yerel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Geliştirme ve önizleme&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;taslak, yayınlanmış&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Aşama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Üretim öncesi doğrulama&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;sadece yayınlandı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Üretim&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kamu sitesi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sadece yayınlanmış&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_genişletilebilirlik&quot;&gt;Genişletilebilirlik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_yeni_özellikler_ekleme&quot;&gt;Yeni özellikler ekleme&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veri modelini zenginleştirmek için sadece yeni önekli özellikler ekleyin.&lt;code&gt;project-*&lt;/code&gt;(empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;project-awards&lt;/code&gt;: Ödüller ve takdirler&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`project-testimonial`Müşteri alıntısı&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`project-team-size`Ekip boyutu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`project-budget-range`Bütçe aralığı&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu özellikler, JBake motoru değiştirilmeden şablonlarda otomatik olarak mevcut olur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_gelişmiş_kategorizasyon&quot;&gt;Gelişmiş kategorizasyon&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/diag-plantuml-md5-5485a46e8f62678db4adbe273b4446f0.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;1055&quot; height=&quot;259&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇yi_uygulamalar&quot;&gt;İyi Uygulamalar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_dosya_organizasyonu&quot;&gt;Dosya Organizasyonu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bir dosya = bir proje&lt;/strong&gt; : Birden fazla projeyi karıştırma&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Özel klasöründeki resimler&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;assets/img/portfolio/nom-projet/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tutarlı adlandırmalar&lt;/strong&gt; : araştırma ve bakımı kolaylaştırır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Versioning Git&lt;/strong&gt; : Değişikliklerin tam takibi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇çerik_yönetimi&quot;&gt;İçerik yönetimi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Varsayılan taslak durumu&lt;/strong&gt; : sadece hazır olduğunda yayınla&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yayın öncesi inceleme&lt;/strong&gt; : Kalite ve Gizlilik Doğrulama&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tam Meta Veriler&lt;/strong&gt; : İlgili tüm alanları doldurun&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zengin anlatıcı içerik&lt;/strong&gt; : metavermelerle sınırlı kalmayın&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_performans&quot;&gt;Performans&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Görselleri optimize et&lt;/strong&gt; : commit öncesi sıkıştırma&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pagination si gerekli&lt;/strong&gt; : &amp;gt;20 proje&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lazy loading&lt;/strong&gt; : Galeri görselleri talep üzerine yüklenir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tarayıcı önbelleği&lt;/strong&gt; : varlıklar için uygun başlıklar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu mimari şuna izin verir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kullanım Kolaylığı&lt;/strong&gt; : bir proje eklemek = bir metin dosyası oluşturmak&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esneklik&lt;/strong&gt; : yeni nitelikler aracılığıyla genişletilebilir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bakım kolaylığı&lt;/strong&gt; : içerik/sunum ayrımı&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;izlenebilirlik&lt;/strong&gt; : tam Git versiyonlama&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Otomasyon&lt;/strong&gt; : derleme ve sürekli dağıtım mümkün&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AsciiDoc seçimi, sitenin geri kısmıyla tutarlılığı sağlarken, profesyonel bir portföy için gerekli meta verilerin zenginliğini de sunar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi : 12 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supabase&amp;#8217;in basitliği ve Spring Boot&amp;#8217;un gücü arasında bir seçim yapmak yerine, neden ikisini de birleştirmelisiniz? Her iki teknolojinin en iyisini kullanan bir hibrit mimari keşfedin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
