&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_giriş&quot;&gt;Giriş&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teknik belge hazırlanırken, özellikle stil kılavuzları veya kullanıcı arayüzü spesifikasyonları için, renk paletlerini görüntülemek sıkça gereklidir. AsciiDoc, belgeler için oldukça güçlü olsa da, renk nümunelerini görüntülemek için yerel bir sözdizimi sunmaz. Bu makale, sorunu incelemek ve HTML enjeksiyonu üzerinden şık bir çözüm önermektedir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_problematik&quot;&gt;Problematik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kullanım_bağlamı&quot;&gt;Kullanım bağlamı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir web uygulama temasının CSS değişkenlerini dokümantasyon yapıyorsunuzu hayal edin. Şunlara ihtiyacınız var :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hex renk kodlarını listele&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her renk için görsel bir ön izleme göster&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaynak belgenin okunabilirliğini korumak&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JBake gibi statik site oluşturucularla uyumluluğu sağlamak&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;use-case-diagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;use case diagram&quot; width=&quot;927&quot; height=&quot;192&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_olası_yaklaşımlar&quot;&gt;Olası yaklaşımlar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir AsciiDoc belgesinde renk görüntülemek için çeşitli çözümler düşünülebilir :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;component-diagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;component diagram&quot; width=&quot;898&quot; height=&quot;190&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_seçenek_1_unicode_karakterleri&quot;&gt;Seçenek 1: Unicode karakterleri&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unicode karakterlerin kullanılması olarak`&amp;#9632;`(■) basit ama sınırlı:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* ■ --accent-color: #7952b3 (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sınırlamalar&lt;/strong&gt; : Renk üzerinde kontrol yok, sistem yazı tipine bağlı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_seçenek_2_harici_görüntüler&quot;&gt;Seçenek 2 : Harici Görüntüler&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her renk için PNG veya SVG görüntüler oluşturun:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* image:colors/violet.svg[width=16] --accent-color: #7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sınırlamalar&lt;/strong&gt; : Ağır bakım, dosya sayısının artışı, otomatik senkronizasyon yok.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_seçenek_3_özel_css_roller&quot;&gt;Seçenek 3 : Özel CSS roller&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CSS sınıflarını tanımlayın ve AsciiDoc rollerini kullanarak uygulayın :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* [.color-violet]##■## --accent-color: #7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Limitations&lt;/strong&gt; : Bir harici stil sayfası gereklidir, tüm renklerin önceden tanımlanması gerekir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_seçenek_4_html_enjeksiyonu_seçilen_çözüm&quot;&gt;Seçenek 4 : HTML enjeksiyonu (seçilen çözüm)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Makroyu kullan``HTML&amp;#8217;i inline stillerle eklemek&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;
background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;]
--accent-color: #7952b3 (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çözüm_html_enjeksiyonu_ile&quot;&gt;Çözüm: HTML Enjeksiyonu ile &lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çalışma_ilkesi&quot;&gt;Çalışma ilkesi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Makro``AsciiDoc&amp;#8217;un, AsciiDoc işleyici tarafından yorumlanmayacak ham içerik eklemesine izin verir. Bu, satır içi CSS stilleriyle HTML doğrudan eklememizi sağlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;sequence-diagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;sequence diagram&quot; width=&quot;622&quot; height=&quot;282&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_uygulama&quot;&gt;Uygulama&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İşte enjekte edilecek HTML yapısı:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;
             width:1em;
             height:1em;
             background:#7952b3;
             vertical-align:middle;
             margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_css_özelliklerinin_açıklaması&quot;&gt;CSS özelliklerinin açıklaması&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 75%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Mülk&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Fonksiyon&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;display:inline-block&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;width/height’i ayarlamanıza izin verirken inline akış içinde kalmanızı sağlar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;width:1em; height:1em&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kare boyutu, yazı tipi boyutuna göre (responsive)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;background:#7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Görüntülenecek renk (ihtiyacınıza göre değişken)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;vertical-align:middle&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kareyi yanındaki metinle hizala&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;margin-right:0.5em&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kare ile metin arasındaki boşluk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tam_örnek&quot;&gt;Tam örnek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İşte bir tema paleti belgelenen bir örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;== Thème Clair

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#f8f9fa` (blanc cassé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#61428f;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-hover: `#61428f` (violet plus foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --card-bg: `#ffffff` (blanc)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aşağıdaki renderi kim üretiyor:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Açık Tema&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --bg-primary:`#f8f9fa`(ak beyaz)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --text-primary:`#212529`(çok koyu siyah)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --accent-color:`#7952b3`(menekşe Bootstrap)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#61428f;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --accent-hover:`#61428f`(daha koyu mor)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --card-bg:`#ffffff`(beyaz)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_en_iyileştirmeler_ve_iyi_uygulamalar&quot;&gt;En iyileştirmeler ve iyi uygulamalar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_açık_renkleri_yönet&quot;&gt;Açık renkleri yönet&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Açık renkler (beyaz, çok açık gri) için beyaz arka planda görünür olmaları için bir çerçeve ekleyin:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;
background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;
vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gri kenar (&lt;code&gt;border:1px solid #ccc&lt;/code&gt;) beyaz arka plan üzerinde beyaz kareyi sınırlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_karelerin_boyutunu_ayarla&quot;&gt;Karelerin boyutunu ayarla&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Karelerin boyutunu ihtiyacınıza göre ayarlayabilirsiniz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1.5em;height:1.5em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Grand carré
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:0.8em;height:0.8em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Petit carré&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Birimin kullanımı`em`karelerin yazı boyutuna uyarlanmasını garantiler&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_varyantlar_oluştur&quot;&gt;Varyantlar oluştur&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Özel ihtiyaçlar için farklı şekiller oluşturabilirsiniz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_renkli_daire&quot;&gt;Renkli daire&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Cercle violet&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_renkli_kenarlı_kare&quot;&gt;Renkli kenarlı kare&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:3px solid #7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Bordure violette&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çözüm_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Çözüm mimarisi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;architecture-diagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;architecture diagram&quot; width=&quot;483&quot; height=&quot;412&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_avantajlar_ve_sınırlamalar&quot;&gt;Avantajlar ve sınırlamalar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_avantajlar&quot;&gt;Avantajlar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Autonomie&lt;/strong&gt; : Harici dosyalara bağımlılık yok&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Taşınabilirlik&lt;/strong&gt; : Tüm AsciiDoc işlemcileriyle çalışır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Senkronizasyon&lt;/strong&gt; : Renk kodu doğrudan HTML&amp;#8217;de&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Esneklik&lt;/strong&gt; : Stilin tam kişiselleştirmesi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; : Hexadecimal kodunun basit değişikliği&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;JBake Uyumluluğu&lt;/strong&gt; : Statik site jeneratörleriyle mükemmel şekilde çalışır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_sınırlamalar&quot;&gt;Sınırlamalar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✗ &lt;strong&gt;Sözel açıklık&lt;/strong&gt;: AsciiDoc kaynağında tekrarlanan HTML kodu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaynak okunabilirliği&lt;/strong&gt; : Kaynak belge daha az temiz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Erişilebilirlik&lt;/strong&gt; : Doğal alternatif metin yok (manuel olarak eklenmeli)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_erişilebilirlik_iyileştirmesi&quot;&gt;Erişilebilirlik iyileştirmesi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kareleri ekran okuyuculara erişilebilir hale getirmek için:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span role=&quot;img&quot; aria-label=&quot;Couleur violet Bootstrap&quot;
style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;
vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;]
--accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;özellikler`role=&quot;img&quot;` et `aria-label`Yardım teknolojilerine görsel içeriği anlamak ve açıklamak izni verir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_somut_örnek_temalar_dokümantasyonu&quot;&gt;Somut örnek: Temalar dokümantasyonu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Birden çok konuyu dokümante eden tam bir örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;= Guide des couleurs de l&#39;application

== Thème Clair (`:root`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#f8f9fa` (blanc cassé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)

== Thème Sombre (`[data-bs-theme=&quot;dark&quot;]`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #999;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#ffffff` (blanc)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#0d6efd;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#0d6efd` (bleu Bootstrap)

== Thème Contraste Élevé (`[data-bs-theme=&quot;high-contrast&quot;]`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#000000;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#000000` (noir)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #000;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#ffffff` (blanc)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#00ff00;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#00ff00` (vert vif)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Macro aracılığıyla HTML enjeksiyonu`` d&amp;#8217;AsciiDoc, teknik dokümantasyonda renk örneklerini görüntülemek için şık ve pratik bir çözüm sunar. Hafifçe uzun olsa da, bu yöntem maksimum taşınabilirlik ve basitleştirilmiş bakım sağlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu teknik harici bir yapılandırma gerektirmez, ek bir stil sayfası gerektirmez ve JBake ile tüm standart AsciiDoc işlemcileriyle hemen çalışır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İlk renkli kareyi oluşturduktan sonra, HTML kodunu kopyala-yapıştır yapıp onaltılık kodu değiştirerek hızlıca tam bir palet oluşturabilirsiniz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu teknik, özel görsel işleme gerektiren farklı kullanım durumlarına genişletilebilir: simgeler, rozetler, basit grafikler veya stilinin hassas kontrolü gerektiren herhangi bir görsel öğe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_kaynaklar&quot;&gt;Kaynaklar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.asciidoctor.org/asciidoc/latest/pass/pass-macro/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Belgeleme AsciiDoc : pass macro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jbake.org/docs/2.6.7/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;JBake Dökümantasyon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/CSS/color_value&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;MDN : CSS renk değerleri&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;2025-11-01 tarihinde yayınlanan makale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

