&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_giriş&quot;&gt;Giriş&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İnternasyonelleştirme (i18n) bir statik sitesi ilk bakışta karmaşık görünebilir, ancak JBake Thymeleaf ile birleştirildiğinde çoklu dil desteği olan bir site oluşturmak için şık çözümler sunar. Bu makalede, blogumda i18n&amp;#8217;yi nasıl kurduğumu göstermek, hem şablonlama hem de birden fazla dilde makale yönetimini kapsayacak şekilde ele alacağım.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kullanım_durumu_diyagramı_use_case&quot;&gt;Kullanım durumu diyagramı (Use Case)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-679bcbde5113cbcda61dc0a28c0c948d.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;624&quot; height=&quot;448&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_uluslararasılaştırma_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Uluslararasılaştırma mimarisi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yaklaşımız iki temel üzerine kuruludur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Templating&amp;#8217;in i18n&amp;#8217;i&lt;/strong&gt;: Thymeleaf mesaj dosyalarının kullanımı arayüz öğeleri için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;İçeriğin i18n&amp;#8217;i&lt;/strong&gt;: dil bazlı makalelerin ayrılmış bir klasör yapısında düzenlenmesi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_yapı_şeması_dosya_organizasyonu&quot;&gt;Yapı şeması (Dosya organizasyonu)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-2f100fc3ec2ec37f9556818cdc246602.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;188&quot; height=&quot;513&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_neden_bu_yaklaşım&quot;&gt;Neden bu yaklaşım?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu ayırım izin verirs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Arayüzde dille ne olursa olsun tutarlılığı koruyun&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;içeriği ve makale çevirilerini bağımsız olarak yönet&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yeni dillerin eklenmesini büyük bir refaktörleme yapmadan kolaylaştır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Belirli dillerde sadece mevcut olan makalelere izin ver&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bileşen_diyagramı&quot;&gt;Bileşen diyagramı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-7a294ae278d50380edf9ef020ea825b9.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;1771&quot; height=&quot;477&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_thymeleaf_ile_şablonlama_i18n&quot;&gt;Thymeleaf ile şablonlama I18n&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_mesaj_dosyalarının_yapısı&quot;&gt;Mesaj dosyalarının yapısı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İlk adım, her desteklenen dil için özellik dosyalarını oluşturmaktır :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;src/jbake/templates/
├── messages.properties        # Fallback par défaut
├── messages_fr.properties     # Français
├── messages_en.properties     # Anglais
└── messages_de.properties     # Allemand&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_mesaj_dosyalarının_içeriği&quot;&gt;Mesaj dosyalarının içeriği&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir dosya örneği`messages_fr.properties`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-properties hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;properties&quot;&gt;# Navigation
nav.home=Accueil
nav.blog=Blog
nav.about=À propos
nav.contact=Contact

# Articles
article.readmore=Lire la suite
article.published=Publié le
article.tags=Étiquettes
article.also.available=Également disponible en

# Interface
site.title=Mon Blog Technique
site.description=Partage de connaissances et expériences
footer.copyright=© 2025 Tous droits réservés
search.placeholder=Rechercher un article...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ve onun İngilizce karşılığı`messages_en.properties`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-properties hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;properties&quot;&gt;# Navigation
nav.home=Home
nav.blog=Blog
nav.about=About
nav.contact=Contact

# Articles
article.readmore=Read more
article.published=Published on
article.tags=Tags
article.also.available=Also available in

# Interface
site.title=My Tech Blog
site.description=Sharing knowledge and experiences
footer.copyright=© 2025 All rights reserved
search.placeholder=Search articles...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_şablonlarda_kullanım&quot;&gt;Şablonlarda kullanım&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thymeleaf şablonlarınızda, sözdizimi kullanın`#{}`mesajlara erişmek için:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;!DOCTYPE html&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;html xmlns:th=&quot;http://www.thymeleaf.org&quot;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;head&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;title th:text=&quot;#{site.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Mon Blog&amp;lt;/title&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;meta name=&quot;description&quot; th:content=&quot;#{site.description}&quot; /&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/head&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;body&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;nav&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;@{/}&quot; th:text=&quot;#{nav.home}&quot;&amp;gt;Accueil&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;@{/blog/}&quot; th:text=&quot;#{nav.blog}&quot;&amp;gt;Blog&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;@{/about.html}&quot; th:text=&quot;#{nav.about}&quot;&amp;gt;À propos&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/nav&amp;gt;

    &amp;lt;footer&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;p th:text=&quot;#{footer.copyright}&quot;&amp;gt;Copyright&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/footer&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/body&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/html&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_dizilim_diyagramı_i18n_çözümü&quot;&gt;Dizilim diyagramı - i18n çözümü&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-016b4bb77a40cbea596d64f99174dee0.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;919&quot; height=&quot;882&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_jbakete_yerel_ayar_yapılandırması&quot;&gt;JBake&amp;#8217;te yerel ayar yapılandırması&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dosyanızda`jbake.properties`, varsayılan locale&amp;#8217;yi ayarlayın :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-properties hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;properties&quot;&gt;# Locale par défaut
thymeleaf.locale=fr

# Encodage
template.encoding=UTF-8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_makalelerin_i18ni_klasör_bazlı_organizasyon&quot;&gt;Makalelerin I18n&amp;#8217;i: Klasör bazlı organizasyon&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_akış_diyagramı_flow_oluşturma&quot;&gt;akış diyagramı (Flow) - oluşturma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-b2c3cf0d93ddecd6b2c332a75e12a1cb.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;285&quot; height=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_klasör_yapısı&quot;&gt;Klasör yapısı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dosya adlarında sonek kullanmak yerine, daha fazla açıklık ve bakım kolaylığı sağlayan klasör tabanlı bir organizasyonu tercih ettim:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;content/blog/
├── 2024/
│   ├── fr/
│   │   ├── introduction-jbake.adoc
│   │   ├── guide-thymeleaf.adoc
│   │   └── astuces-asciidoc.adoc
│   └── en/
│       ├── introduction-jbake.adoc
│       ├── thymeleaf-guide.adoc
│       └── asciidoc-tips.adoc
└── 2025/
    ├── fr/
    │   └── internationalisation-jbake.adoc
    └── en/
        └── jbake-internationalization.adoc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bu_yaklaşımın_avantajları&quot;&gt;Bu yaklaşımın avantajları&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu yapı birden fazla avantaja sahiptir :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;net ayrım&lt;/strong&gt;: Her dilin kendi alanı var.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esnek adlandırma&lt;/strong&gt;: dosyaların dila göre farklı isimler olabilir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ölçeklenebilirlik&lt;/strong&gt;: yeni bir dil eklemek kolay&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doğal organizasyon&lt;/strong&gt;JBake&amp;#8217;in zaman mantığını takip eder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_makalelerin_meta_verileri&quot;&gt;Makalelerin meta verileri&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her makale, çeviriler arasında bağlantı kurmak için meta veriler içermelidir. Bir örnek şöyle:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fransızca sürüm&lt;/strong&gt;(&lt;code&gt;2025/fr/internationalisation-jbake.adoc&lt;/code&gt;) :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;= Internationalisation d&#39;un site statique JBake
:jbake-type: post
:jbake-status: published
:jbake-date: 2025-10-20
:jbake-lang: tr
:jbake-article-id: jbake-i18n-thymeleaf
:jbake-tags: jbake, thymeleaf, i18n
:jbake-description: Guide pour mettre en place l&#39;i18n avec JBake&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;İngilizce sürüm&lt;/strong&gt;(&lt;code&gt;2025/en/jbake-internationalization.adoc&lt;/code&gt;) :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;= Internationalizing a JBake Static Site
:jbake-type: post
:jbake-status: published
:jbake-date: 2025-10-20
:jbake-lang: tr
:jbake-article-id: jbake-i18n-thymeleaf
:jbake-tags: jbake, thymeleaf, i18n
:jbake-description: Guide to implement i18n with JBake&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not: Özellik`:jbake-article-id:`kritiktir: bir makalenin farklı çevirileri arasında bağlantı kurar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_url_yapılandırması&quot;&gt;URL yapılandırması&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;içinde`jbake.properties`, URL desenini dil içerecek şekilde yapılandırın:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-properties hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;properties&quot;&gt;# Pattern d&#39;URL avec langue
post.permalink.pattern=:lang/blog/:year/:name.html

# Langue par défaut
site.default.lang=fr&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu şu tür URL&amp;#8217;leri oluşturacaktır:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;/fr/blog/2025/internationalisation-jbake.html&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;/en/blog/2025/jbake-internationalization.html&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çoklu_dil_görüntüleme_şablonları&quot;&gt;Çoklu dil görüntüleme şablonları&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_dil_seçici_makale_şablonu&quot;&gt;Dil seçici makale şablonu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Şablon oluşturun`post.html`Kullanılabilir çevirileri gösteren :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;!DOCTYPE html&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;html xmlns:th=&quot;http://www.thymeleaf.org&quot;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;head&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;title th:text=&quot;${content.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Article&amp;lt;/title&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/head&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;body&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;article&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;header&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;h1 th:text=&quot;${content.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Titre&amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;

            &amp;lt;div class=&quot;article-meta&quot;&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;time th:text=&quot;${#dates.format(content.date, &#39;dd MMMM yyyy&#39;)}&quot;
                      th:attr=&quot;datetime=${#dates.format(content.date, &#39;yyyy-MM-dd&#39;)}&quot;&amp;gt;
                    Date
                &amp;lt;/time&amp;gt;

                &amp;lt;!-- Sélecteur de traductions --&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;div class=&quot;translations&quot; th:if=&quot;${content[&#39;article-id&#39;]}&quot;&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;span th:text=&quot;#{article.also.available}&quot;&amp;gt;Aussi disponible en :&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;ul class=&quot;language-list&quot;&amp;gt;
                        &amp;lt;li th:each=&quot;post : ${published_posts}&quot;
                            th:if=&quot;${post[&#39;article-id&#39;] == content[&#39;article-id&#39;] and post.lang != content.lang}&quot;&amp;gt;
                            &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;${post.uri}&quot;
                               th:text=&quot;${post.lang.toUpperCase()}&quot;&amp;gt;
                                LANG
                            &amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
                        &amp;lt;/li&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;/ul&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/header&amp;gt;

        &amp;lt;div class=&quot;content&quot; th:utext=&quot;${content.body}&quot;&amp;gt;
            Contenu de l&#39;article
        &amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;

        &amp;lt;footer class=&quot;article-footer&quot;&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;div class=&quot;tags&quot; th:if=&quot;${content.tags}&quot;&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;span th:text=&quot;#{article.tags}&quot;&amp;gt;Étiquettes :&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;span th:each=&quot;tag : ${content.tags}&quot;&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;@{/tags/{tag}.html(tag=${tag})}&quot;
                       th:text=&quot;${tag}&quot;&amp;gt;tag&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/footer&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/article&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/body&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/html&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_dil_tarafından_filtrelenmiş_indeks&quot;&gt;Dil tarafından filtrelenmiş indeks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her dil için dizin şablonları oluşturun :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;index.html&lt;/strong&gt;(Fransızca indeks) :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;!DOCTYPE html&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;html xmlns:th=&quot;http://www.thymeleaf.org&quot;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;head&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;title th:text=&quot;#{site.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Mon Blog&amp;lt;/title&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/head&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;body&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;main&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;h1 th:text=&quot;#{nav.blog}&quot;&amp;gt;Blog&amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;

        &amp;lt;div class=&quot;articles-list&quot;&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;article th:each=&quot;post : ${published_posts}&quot;
                     th:if=&quot;${post.lang == &#39;fr&#39;}&quot;&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;h2&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;${post.uri}&quot; th:text=&quot;${post.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Titre&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;/h2&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;time th:text=&quot;${#dates.format(post.date, &#39;dd MMMM yyyy&#39;)}&quot;&amp;gt;
                    Date
                &amp;lt;/time&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;p th:text=&quot;${post.description}&quot;&amp;gt;Description&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;${post.uri}&quot; th:text=&quot;#{article.readmore}&quot;&amp;gt;
                    Lire la suite
                &amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;/article&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/main&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/body&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/html&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;index_en.html&lt;/strong&gt;(İngiliz indeksi) :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;!DOCTYPE html&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;html xmlns:th=&quot;http://www.thymeleaf.org&quot;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;head&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;title th:text=&quot;#{site.title}&quot;&amp;gt;My Blog&amp;lt;/title&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/head&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;body&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;main&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;h1 th:text=&quot;#{nav.blog}&quot;&amp;gt;Blog&amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;

        &amp;lt;div class=&quot;articles-list&quot;&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;article th:each=&quot;post : ${published_posts}&quot;
                     th:if=&quot;${post.lang == &#39;en&#39;}&quot;&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;h2&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;${post.uri}&quot; th:text=&quot;${post.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Title&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;/h2&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;time th:text=&quot;${#dates.format(post.date, &#39;dd MMMM yyyy&#39;)}&quot;&amp;gt;
                    Date
                &amp;lt;/time&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;p th:text=&quot;${post.description}&quot;&amp;gt;Description&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;a th:href=&quot;${post.uri}&quot; th:text=&quot;#{article.readmore}&quot;&amp;gt;
                    Read more
                &amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;/article&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/main&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/body&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/html&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_diller_arasında_gezinme&quot;&gt;Diller arasında gezinme&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_global_dil_seçici&quot;&gt;Global dil seçici&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_akış_diyagramı_kullanıcı_okuması&quot;&gt;Akış diyagramı - Kullanıcı okuması&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-35c457cfbd1b9be0156f6bbbfb2925d1.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;494&quot; height=&quot;761&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ana şablonunuza bir dil seçici ekleyin :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;nav class=&quot;language-switcher&quot;&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;a href=&quot;/index.html&quot;
       th:classappend=&quot;${content.lang == &#39;fr&#39;} ? &#39;active&#39;&quot;
       title=&quot;Français&quot;&amp;gt;
        🇫🇷 FR
    &amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;a href=&quot;/en/index.html&quot;
       th:classappend=&quot;${content.lang == &#39;en&#39;} ? &#39;active&#39;&quot;
       title=&quot;English&quot;&amp;gt;
        🇬🇧 EN
    &amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/nav&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_seçici_için_css_stil&quot;&gt;Seçici için CSS stil&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-css hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;css&quot;&gt;.language-switcher {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: #f5f5f5;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.language-switcher a {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #333;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
}

.language-switcher a:hover {
    background: #e0e0e0;
}

.language-switcher a.active {
    background: #007bff;
    color: white;
}

.translations {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
}

.language-list {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
}

.language-list li::after {
    content: &quot;•&quot;;
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
}

.language-list li:last-child::after {
    content: &quot;&quot;;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_dil_bazlı_rss_akışı&quot;&gt;Dil bazlı RSS akışı&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dilara ayrılmış RSS akışları almak için, ayrı şablonlar oluşturun :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;feed.xml&lt;/strong&gt;( Français akım) :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-xml hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;xml&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;rss version=&quot;2.0&quot; xmlns:th=&quot;http://www.thymeleaf.org&quot;&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;channel&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;title th:text=&quot;#{site.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Mon Blog&amp;lt;/title&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;link th:text=&quot;${config.site_host}&quot;&amp;gt;http://example.com&amp;lt;/link&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;description th:text=&quot;#{site.description}&quot;&amp;gt;Description&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;language&amp;gt;fr&amp;lt;/language&amp;gt;

        &amp;lt;item th:each=&quot;post : ${published_posts}&quot;
              th:if=&quot;${post.lang == &#39;fr&#39;}&quot;&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;title th:text=&quot;${post.title}&quot;&amp;gt;Titre&amp;lt;/title&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;link th:text=&quot;${config.site_host + post.uri}&quot;&amp;gt;Lien&amp;lt;/link&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;pubDate th:text=&quot;${#dates.format(post.date, &#39;EEE, dd MMM yyyy HH:mm:ss Z&#39;)}&quot;&amp;gt;
                Date
            &amp;lt;/pubDate&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;description th:text=&quot;${post.description}&quot;&amp;gt;Description&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/item&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/channel&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/rss&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇yi_uygulamalar_ve_ipuçları&quot;&gt;İyi uygulamalar ve ipuçları&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_1_makale_kimlik_tutarlılığı&quot;&gt;1. Makale kimlik tutarlılığı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Emin olun ki`:jbake-article-id:`Bütün bir makalenin çevirileri için aynıdır. Tutarlı bir format kullanın:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Küresellik için İngilizce tanımlayıcıları tercih edin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kelimeleri ayırmak için tiret kullanın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Özel karakterlerden kaçının&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_2_tutarlı_tarihler&quot;&gt;2. Tutarlı tarihler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir makalenin tüm çevirileri aynı yayın tarihine sahip olmalıdır.&lt;code&gt;:jbake-date:&lt;/code&gt;). Bu, sıralama ve kronolojik görüntülemeyi kolaylaştırır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_3_çok_dilli_etiketler&quot;&gt;3. Çok dilli etiketler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Etiketler için iki seçeneğiniz var:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seçenek 1: İngilizce evrensel etiketler&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;:jbake-tags: java, spring-boot, microservices&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seçenek 2: Eşlemeyle çevrilmiş etiketler&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;# Version française
:jbake-tags: java, spring-boot, microservices

# Version anglaise
:jbake-tags: java, spring-boot, microservices&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_4_çevirilmemiş_makalelerin_yönetimi&quot;&gt;4. Çevirilmemiş makalelerin yönetimi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tüm makaleleri çevirmek zorunlu değildir. Bir makale sadece bir dilde mevcutsa, diğer dildeki listelerde görünmez olur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_5_çok_dilli_site_haritası&quot;&gt;5. Çok dilli site haritası&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tüm dilleri içeren bir site haritası oluşturun :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-xml hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;xml&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;urlset xmlns=&quot;http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9&quot;
        xmlns:xhtml=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;
        xmlns:th=&quot;http://www.thymeleaf.org&quot;&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;url th:each=&quot;post : ${published_posts}&quot;&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;loc th:text=&quot;${config.site_host + post.uri}&quot;&amp;gt;URL&amp;lt;/loc&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;lastmod th:text=&quot;${#dates.format(post.date, &#39;yyyy-MM-dd&#39;)}&quot;&amp;gt;Date&amp;lt;/lastmod&amp;gt;

        &amp;lt;!-- Liens alternatifs pour les traductions --&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;xhtml:link th:each=&quot;translation : ${published_posts}&quot;
                    th:if=&quot;${translation[&#39;article-id&#39;] == post[&#39;article-id&#39;] and translation.lang != post.lang}&quot;
                    rel=&quot;alternate&quot;
                    th:attr=&quot;hreflang=${translation.lang},href=${config.site_host + translation.uri}&quot; /&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/url&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/urlset&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JBake sitesinin Thymeleaf ile uluslararasılaştırılması, sağlam ve sürdürülebilir bir yaklaşımdır. Şablondan (mesaj dosyaları üzerinden) ve içerikten (klasör organizasyonu üzerinden) i18n&amp;#8217;i ayırarak, kolayca gelişebilecek esnek bir sistem elde edersiniz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aklınızda bulundurmanız gereken önemli noktalar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thymeleaf mesaj dosyaları&lt;/strong&gt;kullanıcı arayüzü için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dossiye göre düzenleme&lt;/strong&gt;(yıl/dil) makaleler için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ürün kimlikleri&lt;/strong&gt;pour lier les traductions
→  çevirileri bağlamak&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;özel şablonlar&lt;/strong&gt;her dil için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Açık URL&amp;#8217;ler&lt;/strong&gt;dil kodunu içeren&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_dağıtım_diyagramı&quot;&gt;Dağıtım diyagramı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-abe3aab787b24d7250922c185dd9df02.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;492&quot; height=&quot;724&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu mimari, sadece iki dil ile başlangıç yapmanızı ve büyük bir refaktörleme yapmadan diğer dilleri eklemenizi sağlar. Tüm şey tamamen statik ve performant kalır, JBake felsefesine sadık kalır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çok dilli geliştirme iyi geçsin! 🌍&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

