&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_giriş&quot;&gt;Giriş&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gradle eklentisi geliştirilirken&lt;strong&gt;Fırın&lt;/strong&gt;JBake blogum için, basit görünen bir sorunla karşılaştım: Bir birim testi hatayla başarısız`Wanted but not invoked`. Görünüşe göre küçük bir hata gibi görünen şey, aslında Mockito ve Kotlin ile mocklamanın ince ayrıntılarını anlamak için mükemmel bir örneğiydi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu makalede, metodik bir hata ayıklama yolculuğuna sizi götürüyorum; her çözüm yeni bir sorun ortaya çıkarıyor ve nihai çözüme kadar devam ediyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bağlam_gradle_bakery_eklentisi&quot;&gt;Bağlam: Gradle Bakery eklentisi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bakery eklentisi, statik sitelerin yayınlanmasını kolaylaştıran JBake&amp;#8217;in bir sarmalayıcısıdır. Basitleştirilmiş yapısı şöyledir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;class BakeryPlugin : Plugin&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
    override fun apply(project: Project) {
        val extension = project.extensions.create(
            &quot;bakery&quot;,
            BakeryExtension::class.java
        )

        project.afterEvaluate {
            if (!project.layout.projectDirectory.asFile
                    .resolve(extension.configPath.get()).exists()) {
                println(&quot;config file does not exists&quot;)
            } else {
                // C&#39;EST ICI QUE ÇA SE PASSE
                project.plugins.apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)

                val site = FileSystemManager.from(project, extension.configPath.get())
                // Configuration de JBake...
            }
        }
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Başarısız olan test basitt :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Test
fun `plugin applies jbake gradle plugin`() {
    val project = createMockProject()
    val plugin = BakeryPlugin()

    plugin.apply(project)

    verify(project.plugins).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hata:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;Wanted but not invoked:
pluginContainer.apply(class org.jbake.gradle.JBakePlugin);
Actually, there were zero interactions with this mock.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_problem_1_yanlış_mocku_kontrol_et&quot;&gt;Problem #1 : Yanlış mocku kontrol et&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tanı&quot;&gt;Tanı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/mockito-problem-1.svg&quot; alt=&quot;mockito problem 1&quot; width=&quot;687&quot; height=&quot;506&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sorun : Mockito etkileşimlerini izleyemez`project.plugins`çünkü sadece gerçek mock&amp;#8217;u döndüren bir getterdir`mockPluginContainer`. Doğrulama doğrudan mock örneği üzerinde yapılmalı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çözüm&quot;&gt;Çözüm&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Değiştir`createMockProject()`iki nesneyi geri döndürmek için :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    val mockPluginContainer = mock&amp;lt;PluginContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
        on { plugins } doReturn mockPluginContainer
    }
    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ve testi uyarlayın:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Test
fun `plugin applies jbake gradle plugin`() {
    val (project, mockPluginContainer) = createMockProject()
    val plugin = BakeryPlugin()

    plugin.apply(project)

    // ✅ Vérification directe sur le bon mock
    verify(mockPluginContainer).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun_2_zincirli_unfinishedstubbingexception&quot;&gt;Sorun #2 : Zincirli UnfinishedStubbingException&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tanı_2&quot;&gt;Tanı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Birinci düzeltme uygulandığında, yeni bir hata ortaya çıktı :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;UnfinishedStubbingException:
Unfinished stubbing detected here
Hints:
 3. you are stubbing the behaviour of another mock inside
    before &#39;thenReturn&#39; instruction is completed&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sorunlu kod, Mockito-Kotlin&amp;#8217;in DSL sözdizimini kullanıyordu :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
    on { extensions } doReturn mockExtensionContainer
    on { plugins } doReturn mockPluginContainer
    on { logger } doReturn mock()  // ❌ PROBLÈME ICI !
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/mockito-problem-2.svg&quot; alt=&quot;mockito problem 2&quot; width=&quot;789&quot; height=&quot;286&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çözüm_2&quot;&gt;Çözüm&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;oluştur&lt;strong&gt;her şey&lt;/strong&gt;mock&amp;#8217;lar stubbing bloğu dışında, sonra bunları ile yapılandırma`whenever()`(empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // 1️⃣ Créer TOUS les mocks d&#39;abord
    val mockPluginContainer = mock&amp;lt;PluginContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockExtensionContainer = mock&amp;lt;ExtensionContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockLogger = mock&amp;lt;org.gradle.api.logging.Logger&amp;gt;()
    val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;()

    // 2️⃣ Configurer les mocks séparément avec whenever()
    whenever(mockProject.plugins).thenReturn(mockPluginContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.extensions).thenReturn(mockExtensionContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.logger).thenReturn(mockLogger)

    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Altın kural&lt;/strong&gt;: Asla arama yapma`mock()`Bir mock yapılandırma bloğunun içinde. Mock&amp;#8217;ları her zaman önce oluşturun, ardından yapılandırın.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun_3_yapılandırma_dosyası_bulunamadı&quot;&gt;Sorun #3 : Yapılandırma dosyası bulunamadı&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_teşhis&quot;&gt;Teşhis&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doğru mock&amp;#8217;lar kullanılmış olsa bile, test daima başarısız oluyordu çünkü plugin yapılandırma dosyasını bulamıyordu:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// Dans BakeryPlugin.kt
if (!project.layout.projectDirectory.asFile
        .resolve(extension.configPath.get()).exists()) {
    println(&quot;config file does not exists&quot;)
    return@afterEvaluate  // ❌ Sort avant d&#39;appliquer JBake !
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/mockito-problem-3.svg&quot; alt=&quot;mockito problem 3&quot; width=&quot;620&quot; height=&quot;350&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çözüm_3&quot;&gt;Çözüm&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yol çözünmesi çalışacak şekilde mockları yapılandırın :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // ... autres mocks ...

    val configFile = File(&quot;../../site.yml&quot;).canonicalFile
    val projectDir = configFile.parentFile

    // Configuration cohérente des chemins
    whenever(mockConfigPathProperty.get()).thenReturn(&quot;site.yml&quot;)
    whenever(mockProjectDirectory.asFile).thenReturn(projectDir)

    // Maintenant : projectDir.resolve(&quot;site.yml&quot;) existe ! ✅
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/path-resolution.svg&quot; alt=&quot;path resolution&quot; width=&quot;618&quot; height=&quot;189&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun_4_afterevaluate_ve_nullpointerexception&quot;&gt;Sorun #4 : afterEvaluate ve NullPointerException&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tanı_3&quot;&gt;Tanı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti JBake&amp;#8217;i bir blokta uygular`afterEvaluate`, ve erişir`buildDirectory.dir()`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.afterEvaluate {
    // ...
    project.tasks.withType(JBakeTask::class.java)
        .getByName(&quot;bake&quot;).apply {
            output = project.layout.buildDirectory
                .dir(site.bake.destDirPath)  // ❌ NPE ici !
                .get()
                .asFile
        }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mock&amp;#8217;un`buildDirectory.dir()&lt;code&gt;dönüyordu`null&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çözüm_4&quot;&gt;Çözüm&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;alay etmek`afterEvaluate`hemen yürütülmesi için ve tamamen yapılandırılması`buildDirectory`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // ... autres mocks ...

    val mockBuildDirectory = mock&amp;lt;DirectoryProperty&amp;gt;()
    val buildDir = File(projectDir, &quot;build&quot;)

    // Mocker dir() pour retourner un Provider valide
    whenever(mockBuildDirectory.dir(any&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val path = invocation.arguments[0] as String
        val mockDirProvider = mock&amp;lt;Provider&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;&amp;gt;()
        val mockDir = mock&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;()

        whenever(mockDir.asFile).thenReturn(File(buildDir, path))
        whenever(mockDirProvider.get()).thenReturn(mockDir)

        mockDirProvider
    }

    // Mocker afterEvaluate pour exécution immédiate
    whenever(mockProject.afterEvaluate(any&amp;lt;Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val action = invocation.arguments[0] as Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;
        action.execute(mockProject)  // ✅ Exécution synchrone
        null
    }

    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/after-evaluate-flow.svg&quot; alt=&quot;after evaluate flow&quot; width=&quot;782&quot; height=&quot;342&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_tam_çözüm&quot;&gt;Tam çözüm&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İşte fonksiyon`createMockProject()`Son, tüm sorunları çözen:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // 1️⃣ CRÉER tous les mocks (pas de nested mocks !)
    val mockPluginContainer = mock&amp;lt;PluginContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockExtensionContainer = mock&amp;lt;ExtensionContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockLogger = mock&amp;lt;org.gradle.api.logging.Logger&amp;gt;()
    val mockTaskContainer = mock&amp;lt;TaskContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockConfigPathProperty = mock&amp;lt;Property&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;&amp;gt;()
    val mockBakeryExtension = mock&amp;lt;BakeryExtension&amp;gt;()
    val mockProjectDirectory = mock&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;()
    val mockBuildDirectory = mock&amp;lt;DirectoryProperty&amp;gt;()
    val mockProjectLayout = mock&amp;lt;ProjectLayout&amp;gt;()
    val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;()

    // 2️⃣ CONFIGURER la résolution des chemins
    val configFile = File(&quot;../../site.yml&quot;).canonicalFile
    val projectDir = configFile.parentFile
    val buildDir = File(projectDir, &quot;build&quot;)

    whenever(mockConfigPathProperty.get()).thenReturn(&quot;site.yml&quot;)
    whenever(mockConfigPathProperty.isPresent).thenReturn(true)
    whenever(mockBakeryExtension.configPath).thenReturn(mockConfigPathProperty)
    whenever(mockProjectDirectory.asFile).thenReturn(projectDir)

    // 3️⃣ CONFIGURER buildDirectory avec dir()
    whenever(mockBuildDirectory.dir(any&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val path = invocation.arguments[0] as String
        val mockDirProvider = mock&amp;lt;Provider&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;&amp;gt;()
        val mockDir = mock&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;()
        whenever(mockDir.asFile).thenReturn(File(buildDir, path))
        whenever(mockDirProvider.get()).thenReturn(mockDir)
        mockDirProvider
    }

    // 4️⃣ ASSEMBLER le projet
    whenever(mockProjectLayout.projectDirectory).thenReturn(mockProjectDirectory)
    whenever(mockProjectLayout.buildDirectory).thenReturn(mockBuildDirectory)

    whenever(mockExtensionContainer.create(&quot;bakery&quot;, BakeryExtension::class.java))
        .thenReturn(mockBakeryExtension)
    whenever(mockExtensionContainer.getByType(BakeryExtension::class.java))
        .thenReturn(mockBakeryExtension)

    whenever(mockProject.extensions).thenReturn(mockExtensionContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.plugins).thenReturn(mockPluginContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.tasks).thenReturn(mockTaskContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.layout).thenReturn(mockProjectLayout)
    whenever(mockProject.logger).thenReturn(mockLogger)
    whenever(mockProject.projectDir).thenReturn(projectDir)

    // 5️⃣ CONFIGURER afterEvaluate pour exécution immédiate
    whenever(mockProject.afterEvaluate(any&amp;lt;Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val action = invocation.arguments[0] as Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;
        action.execute(mockProject)
        null
    }

    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ve final test geçer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Test
fun `plugin applies jbake gradle plugin`() {
    val (project, mockPluginContainer) = createMockProject()
    val plugin = BakeryPlugin()

    plugin.apply(project)

    verify(mockPluginContainer).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java) // ✅ SUCCÈS !
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_öğrenilen_dersler&quot;&gt;Öğrenilen dersler&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/lessons-learned.svg&quot; alt=&quot;lessons learned&quot; width=&quot;748&quot; height=&quot;472&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_doğru_mocku_kontrol_edin&quot;&gt;Doğru mock&amp;#8217;u kontrol edin&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ❌ FAUX
verify(project.plugins).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)

// ✅ CORRECT
val (project, mockPluginContainer) = createMockProject()
verify(mockPluginContainer).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_2_i̇ç_içe_mockları_kullanmaktan_kaçının&quot;&gt;2. İç içe mock&amp;#8217;ları kullanmaktan kaçının&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ❌ FAUX - UnfinishedStubbingException
val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
    on { logger } doReturn mock()  // Nested mock creation !
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Créer séparément
val mockLogger = mock&amp;lt;org.gradle.api.logging.Logger&amp;gt;()
val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;()
whenever(mockProject.logger).thenReturn(mockLogger)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_3_değerlendirme_geri_çağırmalarını_taklit_edin&quot;&gt;3. Değerlendirme geri çağırmalarını taklit edin&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ✅ afterEvaluate doit s&#39;exécuter pour les tests
whenever(mockProject.afterEvaluate(any())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
    val action = invocation.arguments[0] as Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;
    action.execute(mockProject)
    null
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_4_yol_çözümlemesini_test_et&quot;&gt;4. Yol çözümlemesini test et&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// Toujours vérifier que les chemins se résolvent correctement
val extension = project.extensions.getByType(BakeryExtension::class.java)
val configPath = extension.configPath.get()
val projectDir = project.layout.projectDirectory.asFile
val resolvedConfig = projectDir.resolve(configPath)

println(&quot;Resolved config: ${resolvedConfig.absolutePath}&quot;)
println(&quot;Exists: ${resolvedConfig.exists()}&quot;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_final_test_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Final test mimarisi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/test-architecture.svg&quot; alt=&quot;test architecture&quot; width=&quot;707&quot; height=&quot;598&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basit bir test sorunu gibi görünen şey, bir konu üzerinde mükemmel bir vaka çalışması olarak ortaya çıktı :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kotlin ile Mockito&amp;#8217;nun incelikleri&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doğru nesneleri mock etmenin önemi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Testlerde asenkron callback yönetimi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gradle ektentilerdeki yol çözümleme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metodolojik hata ayıklama, sorunun her katmanını anlayarak güçlü ve sürdürülebilir bir çözüm elde edilmesine olanak tanımıştır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testleriniz için tavsiye&lt;/strong&gt;: &quot;Wanted but not invoked&quot; Mockito ile, her zaman kendinize şunu sorun :
1. Doğru mock&amp;#8217;u mu kontrol ediyorum?
2. Tüm mocklarım konfigürasyon blokları dışında mı oluşturuluyor?
3. Callback&amp;#8217;lar gerçekten çalışıyor mu?
4. Yollarım doğru bir şekilde çözülüyor mu?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_kaynaklar&quot;&gt;Kaynaklar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mockito/mockito-kotlin&quot;&gt;Mockito-Kotlin Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/custom_plugins.html&quot;&gt;Gradle Eklenti Geliştirme Kılavuzu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jbake.org/&quot;&gt;JBake Statik Site Oluşturucu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Testlerinizde benzer sorunlarla karşılaştınız mı? Deneyiminizi yorumlarda paylaşın!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;İçindekiler&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_giriş&quot;&gt;Giriş&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_either_monadı_nedir&quot;&gt;Either monadı nedir?&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_eitheri_neden_kullanmalıyız&quot;&gt;Either&amp;#8217;i neden kullanmalıyız?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_bağlam&quot;&gt;Bağlam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_farklı_yaklaşımlar&quot;&gt;Farklı yaklaşımlar&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_klasik_yaklaşım_when_ile&quot;&gt;Klasik yaklaşım &lt;code&gt;when&lt;/code&gt; ile&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_kullanım_fold_için_daha_özlü_bir_yaklaşım&quot;&gt;Kullanım &lt;code&gt;fold&lt;/code&gt; için daha özlü bir yaklaşım&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_dönüşüm_map_ve_mapleft_ile&quot;&gt;Dönüşüm &lt;code&gt;map&lt;/code&gt; ve &lt;code&gt;mapLeft&lt;/code&gt; ile&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_hata_yönetimi_ile_getorelse&quot;&gt;Hata yönetimi ile `getOrElse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_yan_eylemler_ile_onleft_ve_onright&quot;&gt;Yan eylemler ile &lt;code&gt;onLeft&lt;/code&gt; ve `onRight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_flatmap_ile_işlem_zincirleme&quot;&gt;flatMap` ile işlem zincirleme&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_i̇ki_yönlü_dönüşüm_bimap_ile&quot;&gt;İki yönlü dönüşüm &lt;code&gt;bimap&lt;/code&gt; ile&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_swap_ile_kenarların_ters_çevrilmesi&quot;&gt;swap` ile kenarların ters çevrilmesi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_kullanım_tap_ve_tapleft&quot;&gt;Kullanım &lt;code&gt;tap&lt;/code&gt; ve &lt;code&gt;tapLeft&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_kullanım_recover&quot;&gt;Kullanım &lt;code&gt;recover&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_pratik_kullanım_örnekleri&quot;&gt;Pratik kullanım örnekleri&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_daha_ileri_gitmek_için&quot;&gt;Daha ileri gitmek için&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
