&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/&quot;&gt;Apple insan arayüz yönergeleri&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
