&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_links_askubuntu&quot;&gt;Links: &lt;a href=&quot;https://askubuntu.com/questions/86849/how-to-unzip-a-zip-file-from-the-terminal&quot;&gt;askubuntu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Belirli bir hedef klasöre çıkarmak isterseniz, şunu kullanabilirsiniz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
